{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ACCENTURE (NYSE: ACN) AGREED TO ACQUIRE NYTEC INC.', 'text': 'ACCENTURE PLC (NYSE:ACN) SIGNED AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE NYTEC INC. ON OCTOBER 3, 2019. THE TRANSACTION IS SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS. GROWTHPOINT TECHNOLOGY PARTNERS, LLC ACTED AS FINANCIAL ADVISOR TO NYTEC INC.\n'}{'symbol': 'ADBE', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'BOX AND ADOBE STREAMLINE SEAMLESS, SECURE COLLABORATION IN THE CLOUD', 'text': 'BOX ANNOUNCED PLANS WITH ADOBE TO DEEPLY INTEGRATE A FULL-FEATURED ACROBAT WEB EXPERIENCE, INCLUDING POWERFUL CAPABILITIES TO MODIFY, ORGANIZE, SIGN, AND COLLABORATE ON PDFS DIRECTLY IN BOX. THE NEW INTEGRATION WILL SEAMLESSLY CONNECT COLLABORATIVE WORKFLOWS FOR ENTERPRISES WHO RELY ON BOX AND ADOBE, MAKING IT EASIER AND MORE SECURE TO WORK WITH DIGITAL DOCUMENTS IN THE CLOUD. WITH THE NEW INTEGRATION, USERS WILL BE ABLE TO TAKE ACTIONS DIRECTLY FROM BOX TO: CREATE HIGH-QUALITY PDFS THAT PRESERVE FONTS, FORMATTING, AND LAYOUTS; MODIFY AND ORGANIZE EXISTING PDFS WITH THE AVAILABLE DELETE, REORDER, AND ROTATE CAPABILITIES; COMBINE MULTIPLE FILE TYPES, INCLUDING PDF, MICROSOFT OFFICE, IMAGE, TEXT, AND ADOBE DESIGN INTO ONE THAT USER CAN USE FOR ARCHIVING OR DISTRIBUTION; EXPORT PDFS INTO EDITABLE MICROSOFT WORD, EXCEL, POWERPOINT, OR RTF FILES THAT PRESERVE FONTS, FORMATTING, AND LAYOUTS; SEND A DOCUMENT FOR SIGNATURE FROM THE BOX RECOMMENDED APPS EXPERIENCE, A RICH LIST OF CURATED, CONTEXTUAL APPLICATIONS SURFACED FOR USERS WHENEVER THEY PREVIEW A FILE IN BOX; CAPTURE E-SIGNATURE ACTIVITY IN THE BOX ACTIVITY STREAM, A CENTRAL PLACE TO VIEW ALL THE ACTIVITY RELATED TO A FILE BOTH ON BOX AND ACROSS ALL THIRD-PARTY APPLICATIONS. ALL WORK DONE WITH ADOBE ACROBAT TOOLS WILL BE SAVED BACK TO BOX, PRESERVING VERSIONS AND MAKING IT EASY TO SHARE AND COLLABORATE ON THE FILE AND RELATED WORKFLOWS DIRECTLY IN THE BOX EXPERIENCE. BOX AND ADOBE ARE COMMITTED TO WORKING CLOSELY ON FUTURE INTEGRATIONS WITH ADOBE ACROBAT AND ADOBE SIGN FOR MOBILE AND WEB USERS TO MEET THE NEEDS OF TODAY’S RAPIDLY EVOLVING WORKFORCE. THE BOX AND ADOBE INTEGRATIONS WILL BE AVAILABLE NEXT YEAR.'}{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'THX LTD. AND AMD JOIN FORCES TO BRING BREAKTHROUGH ENTERTAINMENT EXPERIENCES ON LAPTOPS', 'text': 'THX LTD. ANNOUNCED THE AVAILABILITY OF TWO NEW AMD POWERED MOTILE LAPTOPS EXCLUSIVELY AVAILABLE ON WALMART.COM. DESIGNED FOR EFFICIENT PRODUCTIVITY FOR ON-THE-GO LIFESTYLES, THESE DEVICES WILL ARRIVE IN MARKET JUST IN TIME FOR THE FALL AND HOLIDAY SHOPPING SEASONS. THE MOTILE DEVICES ARE POWERED BY AMD RYZEN™ MOBILE PROCESSORS, BRINGING POWERFUL COMPUTING PERFORMANCE AND BRILLIANT ENTERTAINMENT EXPERIENCES. COMPLEMENTED WITH THX SPATIAL AUDIO TECHNOLOGY FOR AN ENHANCED SOUND EXPERIENCE AND TUNED BY THX DISPLAYS TO PROVIDE RICHER, MORE VIBRANT COLORS AND BETTER CONTRAST, THESE DEVICES ARE EXPECTED TO GREATLY IMPROVE AUDIO AND VIDEO PLAYBACK FOR CONSUMERS. MOTILE - TUNED BY THX AND THX SPATIAL AUDIO: MOTILE, A PRIVATE-LABEL ELECTRONICS BRAND EXCLUSIVELY SOLD ON WALMART.COM, WELCOMES TWO NEW MOTILE LAPTOPS TO ITS EXISTING LINEUP OF ELECTRONICS ACCESSORIES. THE TWO NEW MOTILE LAPTOPS HAVE TUNED BY THX FOR A BETTER VIEWING EXPERIENCE, ENSURING CRISPER IMAGES AND BRIGHTER COLORS, AS WELL AS IMMERSIVE, SURROUND AUDIO WITH THX SPATIAL AUDIO. SIMPLY PUT, WITH THX SPATIAL AUDIO OVER HEADPHONES, THE USER IS IN THE CENTER OF THE ACTION AND EXPERIENCES IMMERSION SIMILAR TO HOW AUDIO SOUNDS IN REAL-LIFE. AVAILABLE WITH AMD RYZEN™ 5 MOBILE PROCESSORS OR AMD RYZEN™ 3 MOBILE PROCESSORS BOTH WITH BUILT-IN RADEON™ VEGA GRAPHICS, THESE MOTILE DEVICES DELIVER ADVANCED, HIGH PERFORMANCE PROCESSING AND FEATURE THE EXCEPTIONAL GRAPHICS AVAILABLE ON A MOBILE PROCESSOR, MAKING RYZEN PROCESSORS WITH RADEON GRAPHICS THE PERFECT ALL-IN-ONE SOLUTION FOR THOSE LOOKING FOR BLAZING FAST PERFORMANCE, RICH GRAPHICS, AND LONG BATTERY LIFE. POWERED BY AMD RYZEN MOBILE PROCESSORS, MOTILE, WITH BOTH TUNED BY THX AND THX SPATIAL AUDIO FEATURES, ARE PERFORMANCE SERIES LAPTOPS, AND ARE THIN AND LIGHT - DESIGNED FOR USE BY BUSY PEOPLE ON THE GO. THE LAPTOPS RUN WINDOWS 10 AND INCLUDE INTEGRATED GRAPHICS, A MAGNESIUM ALUMINUM CHASSIS, AND A THIN BEZEL DESIGN, EACH WITH A TRAVEL-OPTIMIZED KEYBOARD. THE TWO 14.1-INCH LAPTOPS COST JUST $499.99 (R3/4GB/128GB) AND $599.99 (R5/8GB/256GB), AND ARE EXCLUSIVELY AVAILABLE ON WWW.WALMART.COM.'}{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2019-10-02 13:30:00', 'title': 'AMD, MICROSOFT ANNOUNCE MICROSOFT SURFACE LAPTOP 3', 'text': 'AMD AND MICROSOFT ANNOUNCE NEW 15 INCH THIN AND LIGHT MICROSOFT® SURFACE® LAPTOP 3.'}{'symbol': 'MO', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ROSEN ANNOUNCES FILING OF SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST ALTRIA GROUP, INC', 'text': 'ROSEN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCED THE FILING OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF ALTRIA GROUP, INC. FROM DECEMBER 20, 2018 THROUGH SEPTEMBER 24, 2019, INCLUSIVE (CLASS PERIOD). THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER DAMAGES FOR ALTRIA INVESTORS UNDER THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. ACCORDING TO THE LAWSUIT, DEFENDANTS THROUGHOUT THE CLASS PERIOD MADE FALSE AND/OR MISLEADING STATEMENTS AND/OR FAILED TO DISCLOSE THAT: ALTRIA HAD CONDUCTED INSUFFICIENT DUE DILIGENCE INTO JUUL PRIOR TO THE COMPANY’S $12.8 BILLION INVESTMENT, OR 35% STAKE, IN JUUL; ALTRIA CONSEQUENTLY FAILED TO INFORM INVESTORS, OR ACCOUNT FOR, MATERIAL RISKS ASSOCIATED WITH JUUL’S PRODUCTS AND MARKETING PRACTICES, AND THE TRUE VALUE OF JUUL AND ITS PRODUCTS; ALL OF THE FOREGOING, AS WELL AS MOUNTING PUBLIC SCRUTINY, NEGATIVE PUBLICITY, AND GOVERNMENTAL PRESSURE ON E-VAPOR PRODUCTS AND JUUL MADE IT REASONABLY LIKELY THAT ALTRIA’S INVESTMENT IN JUUL WOULD HAVE A MATERIAL NEGATIVE IMPACT ON THE COMPANY’S REPUTATION AND OPERATIONS; AND AS A RESULT, ALTRIA’S PUBLIC STATEMENTS WERE MATERIALLY FALSE AND MISLEADING AT ALL RELEVANT TIMES. WHEN THE TRUE DETAILS ENTERED THE MARKET, THE LAWSUIT CLAIMS THAT INVESTORS SUFFERED DAMAGES.'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ALEXA AND AMAZON ECHO NOW AVAILABLE IN BRAZIL', 'text': 'AMAZON ANNOUNCED THAT ALEXA NOW SPEAKS BRAZILIAN PORTUGUESE AND IS AVAILABLE FOR CUSTOMERS IN BRAZIL. THIS NEW ALEXA EXPERIENCE IS BUILT FROM THE GROUND UP FOR BRAZIL, AND DEVELOPERS AROUND THE WORLD ARE ALREADY CREATING SKILLS AND DEVICES WITH ALEXA BUILT-IN FOR BRAZILIAN CUSTOMERS. OVER 100 MILLION ALEXA DEVICES HAVE BEEN SOLD GLOBALLY, AND CUSTOMERS HAVE ALSO LEFT OVER 400,000 5-STAR REVIEWS FOR ECHO DEVICES ON AMAZON. ALEXA ARRIVES IN BRAZIL WITH AN ALL-NEW EXPERIENCE BUILT FROM THE GROUND UP FOR BRAZILIAN CUSTOMERS, INCLUDING A BRAND-NEW VOICE, BRAZILIAN PORTUGUESE LANGUAGE SUPPORT, LOCAL KNOWLEDGE, HUNDREDS OF LOCAL SKILLS, A WIDE RANGE OF WORKS WITH ALEXA-CERTIFIED DEVICES, PRODUCTS WITH ALEXA BUILT-IN, AND MORE. ECHO DOT AND ECHO SHOW 5 ARE AVAILABLE FOR PRE-ORDER IN BRAZIL AND WILL BEGIN SHIPPING TO CUSTOMERS STARTING NEXT WEEK, WHILE AMAZON ECHO WILL BE AVAILABLE TO CUSTOMERS IN NOVEMBER. THE LAUNCH FOLLOWS THE LAUNCHES OF AMAZON PRIME AND AMAZON MUSIC, BOTH OF WHICH CAME TO BRAZIL LAST MONTH.'}{'symbol': 'ABC', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'GS1 HEALTHCARE, 36TH GLOBAL GS1 HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE 2019, NOV 05, 2019 THROUGH NOV 07, 2019', 'text': 'GS1 HEALTHCARE, 36TH GLOBAL GS1 HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE 2019, NOV 05, 2019 THROUGH NOV 07, 2019. VENUE:  NEW DELHI , DELHI, INDIA.'}{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ANSYS BOOSTS SUPPORT FOR ON-PREMISE SIMULATION THROUGH IMPROVED ELASTIC LICENSING', 'text': "ANSYS REDUCES COMPLEXITY AND INCREASES FLEXIBILITY FOR CUSTOMERS BY NOW SUPPORTING ON-PREMISE USE AND INTERNET-BASED USAGE MONITORING. PREDICTING WHEN ENGINEERS WILL NEED ACCESS TO MORE SOFTWARE AND HARDWARE RESOURCES IS A SIGNIFICANT BUSINESS CHALLENGE. ANSYS ELASTIC LICENSING ENABLES FLEXIBILITY WHEN ADDITIONAL RESOURCES ARE NEEDED FOR A LIMITED PERIOD OR ON AN OCCASIONAL BASIS. THE IMPROVED ANSYS ELASTIC LICENSING SOLUTION OPTIMIZES BOTH SOFTWARE AND HIGH PERFORMANCE COMPUTING (HPC) UTILIZATION BY PROVIDING FLEXIBLE, USAGE-BASED ACCESS TO THE WORLD'S BROADEST PORTFOLIO OF ENGINEERING SIMULATION SOFTWARE. ANSYS ELASTIC LICENSING CAN BE USED AS A STAND-ALONE OPTION OR IT CAN BE COMBINED WITH OTHER EXISTING LICENSES TO MEET FLUCTUATING DEMANDS. ANSYS ELASTIC UNITS (AEUS) ARE PURCHASED IN PREDETERMINED PACKAGES, OFFER SIMULTANEOUS ACCESS ACROSS THE ANSYS PORTFOLIO AND ARE COMPLETELY INTERNET MANAGED, REMOVING THE NEED FOR A LOCAL LICENSE MANAGER AND ASSOCIATED MAINTENANCE COSTS. ANSYS COLLABORATED WITH FLEXERA TO DEVELOP THE SOFTWARE LICENSING TECHNOLOGY FOR ANSYS ELASTIC LICENSING."}{'symbol': 'AAPL', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ASCENTIAL EVENTS (HANGZHOU) COMPANY LIMITED, MONEY 20/20 CHINA, DEC 04, 2019 THROUGH DEC 06, 2019', 'text': 'ASCENTIAL EVENTS (HANGZHOU) COMPANY LIMITED, MONEY 20/20 CHINA, DEC 04, 2019 THROUGH DEC 06, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'APTV', 'date': '2019-10-02 09:30:00', 'title': 'APTIV TO ACQUIRE GABOCOM IN $310 MILLION DEAL', 'text': 'APTIV TO ACQUIRE GABOCOM.APTIV TO ACQUIRE GABOCOM.APTIV PLC - DEAL FOR $310 MILLION..APTIV PLC - TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO BE MODESTLY ACCRETIVE TO EPS IN 2020..APTIV PLC - UPON COMPLETION OF TRANSACTION, GABOCOM WILL BECOME A PART OF HELLERMANNTYTON.APTIV - ENTERED AGREEMENT TO BUY GABO SYSTEMTECHNIK GMBH FROM FUNDS MANAGED BY BREGAL UNTERNEHMERKAPITAL.'}{'symbol': 'ADM', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ADM ANNOUNCES MILLING STATEMENT REGARDING FLOUR RECALL', 'text': "ADM MILLING CO. ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN NOTIFIED BY THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION THAT SAMPLES OF FLOUR FROM TWO PRODUCTION LOTS MANUFACTURED ON DECEMBER 9, 2018, AND DECEMBER 21, 2018, IN MILL IN BUFFALO, NEW YORK, TESTED POSITIVE FOR E.COLI. OUT OF AN ABUNDANCE OF CAUTION, ADM IS VOLUNTARILY RECALLING ALL FLOUR PRODUCED WITH THE SAME HARD RED WHEAT SOURCE AS THESE IMPACTED LOTS. FDA HAS CONFIRMED THAT THE E.COLI STRAIN FOUND IN THESE SAMPLES MATCHES THE STRAIN PREVIOUSLY FOUND IN FLOUR PRODUCED AT ADM’S BUFFALO MILL. THIS RECALL NOTICE IS AN EXTENSION OF ADM’S PREVIOUS FLOUR RECALL IN MAY AND JUNE EARLIER THIS YEAR. THE COMPANY ARE IN THE PROCESS OF NOTIFYING ALL RETAIL, LARGE PACK AND BULK CUSTOMERS THAT ARE IMPACTED AND ARE WORKING WITH THEM TO ENSURE PRODUCT IS REMOVED FROM SHELVES AND CONSUMERS ARE APPROPRIATELY NOTIFIED. FOOD SAFETY IS THE COMPANY'S FIRST PRIORITY, AND THE COMPANY HAVE A LONG TRACK RECORD OF PROVIDING HIGH-QUALITY, SAFE INGREDIENTS. THE COMPANY ARE WORKING CLOSELY WITH REGULATORS THROUGHOUT THIS PROCESS. THE FLOUR MILLING PROCESS INVOLVES GRINDING AND PROCESSING WHEAT, WHICH IS A RAW AGRICULTURAL COMMODITY THAT IS GROWN UNDER A WIDE RANGE OF ENVIRONMENTAL CONDITIONS. ADM REMINDS CUSTOMERS AND CONSUMERS THAT FLOUR IS NOT READY TO-EAT AND MUST BE THOROUGHLY COOKED BEFORE EATING TO PREVENT ILLNESS FROM POSSIBLE BACTERIA IN THE FLOUR. DO NOT EAT OR PLAY WITH RAW DOUGH, AND WASH HANDS, UTENSILS AND SURFACES AFTER HANDLING. ANY CONSUMERS CONCERNED ABOUT AN ILLNESS SHOULD CONTACT A PHYSICIAN."}{'symbol': 'ANET', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ARISTA NETWORKS, INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 31, 2019', 'text': 'ARISTA NETWORKS, INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 31, 2019'}{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': "BANK OF AMERICA CORPORATION, BANK OF AMERICA MERRILL LYNCH'S SOLAR & ALTERNATIVE ENERGY SYMPOSIUM, DEC 05, 2019", 'text': "BANK OF AMERICA CORPORATION, BANK OF AMERICA MERRILL LYNCH'S SOLAR & ALTERNATIVE ENERGY SYMPOSIUM, DEC 05, 2019. VENUE: NEW YORK, NEW YORK, UNITED STATES."}{'symbol': 'BDX', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY TO REPORT Q4, 2019 RESULTS ON NOV 05, 2019', 'text': 'BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY WILL REPORT Q4, 2019 RESULTS AT 11:00 AM, GMT STANDARD TIME ON NOV 05, 2019'}{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'UNQORK, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED $80 MILLION IN FUNDING FROM CAPITALG, BLACKROCK, INC., SUMMERFIELD CAPITAL MANAGEMENT, LLC, GOLDMAN SACHS PRINCIPAL STRATEGIES, AND OTHER INVESTORS', 'text': 'UNQORK, INC ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED $80 MILLION IN A ROUND OF FUNDING LED BY NEW INVESTOR CAPITALG ON OCTOBER 3, 2019. THE TRANSACTION ALSO INCLUDED PARTICIPATION FROM EXISTING INVESTORS INCLUDING SUMMERFIELD CAPITAL MANAGEMENT, LLC AND GOLDMAN SACHS PRINCIPAL STRATEGIES, AND NEW INVESTORS, FUNDS AND ACCOUNTS UNDER MANAGEMENT BY SUBSIDIARIES OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE:BLK). THE COMPANY HAS RAISED MORE THAN $110 MILLION IN FUNDING TILL DATE.'}{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'OXFORD GLOBAL MARKETING LTD., 2ND ANNUAL ADVANCES IN IMMUNO-ONCOLOGY, OCT 08, 2019 THROUGH OCT 09, 2019', 'text': 'OXFORD GLOBAL MARKETING LTD., 2ND ANNUAL ADVANCES IN IMMUNO-ONCOLOGY, OCT 08, 2019 THROUGH OCT 09, 2019. VENUE: DOUBLETREE BY HILTON HOTEL SAN DIEGO – MISSION VALLEY, 7450 HAZARD CENTER DRIVE, SAN DIEGO, CALIFORNIA, UNITED STATES.'}{'symbol': 'COF', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ROSEN LAW FIRM FILES SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION', 'text': 'ROSEN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCED IT HAS FILED A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION FROM FEBRUARY 2, 2018 THROUGH JUNE 29, 2019, INCLUSIVE. THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER DAMAGES FOR CAPITAL ONE INVESTORS UNDER THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. ACCORDING TO THE LAWSUIT, DEFENDANTS THROUGHOUT THE CLASS PERIOD MADE FALSE AND/OR MISLEADING STATEMENTS AND/OR FAILED TO DISCLOSE THAT: THE COMPANY DID NOT MAINTAIN ROBUST INFORMATION SECURITY PROTECTIONS, AND ITS PROTECTION DID NOT SHIELD PERSONAL INFORMATION AGAINST SECURITY BREACHES; SUCH DEFICIENCIES HEIGHTENED THE COMPANY’S EXPOSURE TO A CYBER-ATTACK; AND AS A RESULT, CAPITAL ONE’S PUBLIC STATEMENTS WERE MATERIALLY FALSE AND MISLEADING AT ALL RELEVANT TIMES. WHEN THE TRUE DETAILS ENTERED THE MARKET, THE LAWSUIT CLAIMS THAT INVESTORS SUFFERED DAMAGES. A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS ALREADY BEEN FILED. A LEAD PLAINTIFF IS A REPRESENTATIVE PARTY ACTING ON BEHALF OF OTHER CLASS MEMBERS IN DIRECTING THE LITIGATION.'}{'symbol': 'CAH', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'CARDINAL HEALTH, INC. PRESENTS AT CONNECT 2019, OCT-08-2019 11:30 AM', 'text': 'CARDINAL HEALTH, INC. PRESENTS AT CONNECT 2019, OCT-08-2019 11:30 AM. VENUE: LOEWS CHICAGO - DOWNTOWN, 455 N PARK DR. CHICAGO, CHICAGO, ILLINOIS, UNITED STATES. SPEAKERS: TINA CLEVELAND, EIT SOLUTION OWNER, STEP PRODUCT MASTER DATA MANAGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2019-10-02 19:30:00', 'title': 'CBOE TO LAUNCH ORDER BOOK PRIORITY FOR RETAIL INVESTORS ON EDGX EXCHANGE', 'text': 'CBOE TO LAUNCH ORDER BOOK PRIORITY FOR RETAIL INVESTORS ON EDGX EXCHANGE.CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS - RECEIVED APPROVAL FROM U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION TO LAUNCH ITS NEW RETAIL PRIORITY PROGRAM ON CBOE EDGX EXCHANGE.CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS INC - EXPECTS TO LAUNCH RETAIL PRIORITY IN NOVEMBER.'}{'symbol': 'CERN', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'CERNER AND I2I POPULATION HEALTH COLLABORATE TO BETTER SERVE MEDICAID POPULATION', 'text': 'CERNER CORPORATION AND I2I POPULATION HEALTH ARE NOW WORKING TOGETHER TO INCREASE THE CARE QUALITY AND REDUCE COSTS FOR MILLIONS THAT DEPEND ON MEDICAID SERVICES THROUGH POPULATION HEALTH MANAGEMENT OFFERINGS. MEDICAID ENROLLMENT IN THE U.S.HIT NEARLY 75 MILLION IN 2018 AND IS EXPECTED TO REACH 81 MILLION IN 2024. NATIONAL MEDICAID SPENDING IS EXPECTED TO INCREASE FROM $629 BILLION TO MORE THAN $884 BILLION IN THE NEXT FIVE YEARS. TOGETHER, CERNER AND I2I WILL USE TECHNOLOGY DESIGNED TO HELP CONTROL COSTS AND IMPROVE THE HEALTH OF MEDICAID POPULATIONS. THE COLLABORATIVE WORK EXPECTS TO DELIVER VALUE DIRECTLY TO STATE MEDICAID, CENTERS FOR MEDICARE & MEDICAID SERVICES (CMS) AND MANAGED CARE STAKEHOLDERS BY COMBINING THEIR RESPECTIVE SCALE AND EXPERTISE IN THE MANAGED MEDICAID MARKET. AS PART OF THIS NEW COLLABORATION, CERNER AND I2I CLIENTS WILL BE ABLE TO LEVERAGE A COMPREHENSIVE BI-DIRECTIONAL INTEGRATION THAT ALLOWS DATA TO FLOW FREELY IN CERNER’S ELECTRONIC HEALTH RECORD (EHR) SYSTEM, HEALTHEINTENT® AND I2I PRODUCT SUITE. THE INTEGRATION WILL PROVIDE AN ENHANCED SET OF POPULATION HEALTH MANAGEMENT CAPABILITIES TO DELIVER DATA-DRIVEN HEALTH INSIGHTS AND HELP CLIENTS BETTER MEET THE NEEDS OF THEIR MEDICAID POPULATION. I2I SERVES APPROXIMATELY ONE-QUARTER OF THE NATION’S FEDERALLY QUALIFIED HEALTH CENTERS, WITH MORE THAN 20 MILLION MEDICAID PATIENTS MANAGED THROUGH ITS TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS. BY WORKING TOGETHER, THE TWO COMPANIES WILL BE BETTER POSITIONED TO SUPPORT SAFETY NET PROVIDER ORGANIZATIONS, STATE MEDICAID DEPARTMENTS AND MANAGED CARE HEALTH PLAN ORGANIZATIONS.'}{'symbol': 'CVX', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'CHEVRON SAYS INTENDS TO LOWER UPSTREAM OIL NET GHG EMISSION INTENSITY BY 5 - 10% FROM 2016 TO 2023', 'text': 'OCT 3  - CHEVRON CORP <CVX.N>::CHEVRON SETS NEW GREENHOUSE GAS REDUCTION GOALS.CHEVRON CORP - ENERGY COMPANY PLANS TO REDUCE EMISSION INTENSITY FROM OIL AND NATURAL GAS PRODUCTION.CHEVRON CORP - INTENDS TO LOWER UPSTREAM OIL NET GHG EMISSION INTENSITY BY 5 - 10 PERCENT FROM 2016 TO 2023.CHEVRON CORP -  INTENDS TO LOWER UPSTREAM NATURAL GAS NET GHG EMISSION INTENSITY BY 2 - 5 PERCENT FROM 2016 TO 2023.'}{'symbol': 'CMG', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'BARCLAYS CAPITAL PLC, BARCLAYS GAMING, LODGING, LEISURE, RESTAURANT & FOOD RETAIL CONFERENCE, DEC 03, 2019 THROUGH DEC 04, 2019', 'text': 'BARCLAYS CAPITAL PLC, BARCLAYS GAMING, LODGING, LEISURE, RESTAURANT & FOOD RETAIL CONFERENCE, DEC 03, 2019 THROUGH DEC 04, 2019. VENUE: NEW YORK, NEW YORK, UNITED STATES.'}{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'CISCO SYSTEMS, INC. PRESENTS AT MOBILE 360 – EURASIA, OCT-08-2019', 'text': 'CISCO SYSTEMS, INC. PRESENTS AT MOBILE 360 – EURASIA, OCT-08-2019 . VENUE: THE LOTTE HOTEL, MOSCOW, RUSSIA. SPEAKERS: GIANLUCA BAINI, MANAGING DIRECTOR EMEAR.'}{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'CITI WINS MANDATE FROM VICTORY CAPITAL TO PROVIDE ADDITIONAL FUND ADMINISTRATION AND CUSTODY SERVICES', 'text': "CITI HAS BEEN APPOINTED BY VICTORY CAPITAL TO PROVIDE FUND ADMINISTRATION, CUSTODY, ETF SERVICES AND SECURITIES LENDING FOR VICTORY'S MOST RECENT ACQUISITION. THE NEW MANDATE RESULTED IN THE TRANSFER OF SERVICING FOR 53 MUTUAL FUNDS AND ETFS TO CITI, REPRESENTING APPROXIMATELY $80 BILLION IN ASSETS UNDER CUSTODY."}{'symbol': 'CLX', 'date': '2019-10-02 18:30:00', 'title': 'CLOROX SEES FISCAL YEAR 2020 SALES DOWN LOW SINGLE DIGITS TO UP 1%', 'text': 'CLOROX INTRODUCES INTEGRATED IGNITE STRATEGY TO INNOVATE FOR GOOD GROWTH, UPDATES FISCAL YEAR OUTLOOK FOR REVISED FOREIGN CURRENCY EXCHANGE ASSUMPTIONS.UNVEILED A NEW, INTEGRATED STRATEGY, IGNITE STRATEGY, TO DRIVE GROWTH AND CREATE VALUE FOR SHAREHOLDERS AND SOCIETY.SEES FISCAL YEAR 2020 SALES DOWN LOW SINGLE DIGITS TO UP 1%.SEES FISCAL YEAR 2020 DILUTED EPS OF $6.05 TO $6.25.SEES FISCAL YEAR 2020 GROSS MARGIN DOWN SLIGHTLY.IGNITE STRATEGY INCLUDES LONG-TERM FINANCIAL GOALS OF GROWING NET SALES 2% TO 4%.IGNITE STRATEGY INCLUDES LONG-TERM FINANCIAL GOALS OF EXPANDING EARNINGS BEFORE INTEREST AND INCOME TAXES MARGIN 25 TO 50 BASIS POINTS.IGNITE STRATEGY INCLUDES LONG-TERM FINANCIAL GOALS OF GENERATING FREE CASH FLOW OF 11% TO 13% OF SALES.FY EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $6.37, REVENUE VIEW $6.26 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP TO LAUNCH E-MINI S&P 500 ESG INDEX FUTURES', 'text': "CME GROUP ANNOUNCED IT WILL LAUNCH E-MINI S&P 500 ESG INDEX FUTURES, A NEW RISK MANAGEMENT TOOL THAT ALIGNS WITH ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) VALUES. THE NEW FUTURES CONTRACTS WILL BE AVAILABLE FOR TRADING ON NOV. 18, 2019, PENDING REGULATORY REVIEW. THE S&P 500 ESG INDEX IS A BROAD-BASED, MARKET-CAP-WEIGHTED INDEX THAT IS DESIGNED TO MEASURE THE PERFORMANCE OF SECURITIES MEETING SUSTAINABILITY CRITERIA, WHILE MAINTAINING SIMILAR OVERALL INDUSTRY GROUP WEIGHTS AS THE S&P 500. THESE NEW CONTRACTS WILL COMPLEMENT CME GROUP'S SUITE OF EQUITY INDEX FUTURES AND OPTIONS CONTRACTS, INCLUDING ITS EXISTING E-MINI S&P 500 FUTURES AND OPTIONS AND MICRO E-MINI S&P 500 FUTURES. E-MINI S&P 500 ESG INDEX FUTURES WILL BE CASH-SETTLED AND WILL BE SUBJECT TO THE RULES AND REGULATIONS OF CME."}{'symbol': 'CTSH', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'COGNIZANT TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS CORPORATION PRESENTS AT CONNECT 2019, OCT-08-2019 01:15 PM', 'text': 'COGNIZANT TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS CORPORATION PRESENTS AT CONNECT 2019, OCT-08-2019 01:15 PM. VENUE: LOEWS CHICAGO - DOWNTOWN, 455 N PARK DR. CHICAGO, CHICAGO, ILLINOIS, UNITED STATES. SPEAKERS: DIPTESH SINGH, COGNIZANT PRACTICE LEAD.'}{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'COMERICA BANK, 2019 OUTLOOK ON AMERICA SYMPOSIUM, OCT 22, 2019', 'text': 'COMERICA BANK, 2019 OUTLOOK ON AMERICA SYMPOSIUM, OCT 22, 2019. VENUE: LA RINCONADA COUNTRY CLUB, 14595 CLEARVIEW DRIVE, LOS GATOS, CALIFORNIA, UNITED STATES.'}{'symbol': 'STZ', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'CONSTELLATION BRANDS, INC. DECLARES CASH DIVIDEND ON CLASS A, B, C COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 22, 2019', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CONSTELLATION BRANDS, INC. DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND IN THE AMOUNT OF $0.75 PER ISSUED AND OUTSTANDING SHARE OF THE COMPANY’S CLASS A COMMON STOCK, $0.68 PER ISSUED AND OUTSTANDING SHARE OF THE COMPANY’S CLASS B COMMON STOCK, AND $0.68 PER ISSUED AND OUTSTANDING SHARE OF THE COMPANY’S CLASS 1 COMMON STOCK, IN EACH CASE PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 22, 2019, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD OF EACH RESPECTIVE CLASS AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 8, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'GLW', 'date': '2019-10-02 13:30:00', 'title': 'CORNING SETS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.20 PER SHARE', 'text': 'SETS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.20PER SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 1, 2019', 'text': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 1, 2019. FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED TOTAL REVENUE WAS USD 47,498 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 44,411 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 1,463 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 1,446 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 1,097 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 1,043 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 2.49 COMPARED TO USD 2.38 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 2.47 COMPARED TO USD 2.36 A YEAR AGO. FOR THE FULL YEAR, TOTAL REVENUE WAS USD 152,703 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 141,576 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 4,737 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 4,480 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 3,659 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 3,134 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 8.32 COMPARED TO USD 7.15 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 8.26 COMPARED TO USD 7.09 A YEAR AGO.'}{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'CSX CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 13, 2019', 'text': "THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CSX CORPORATION APPROVED A $0.24 PER SHARE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 13, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 29, 2019."}{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2019-10-02 18:30:00', 'title': 'CSX CORP SAYS APPOINTED KEVIN BOONE AS CFO', 'text': 'CSX ANNOUNCES EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP APPOINTMENTS.CSX CORP - APPOINTED KEVIN BOONE AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER.CSX CORP - JAMIE BOYCHUK NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT OF OPERATIONS.'}{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'CVS HEALTH CORPORATION ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 4, 2019', 'text': "CVS HEALTH CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS APPROVED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.50 (50 CENTS) PER SHARE ON THE CORPORATION'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 4, 2019, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON OCTOBER 24, 2019."}{'symbol': 'DLR', 'date': '2019-10-02 13:30:00', 'title': 'DIGITAL REALTY ANNOUNCES PRICING OF €500 MILLION OF EURO-DENOMINATED BONDS', 'text': 'DIGITAL REALTY ANNOUNCES PRICING OF €500 MILLION OF EURO-DENOMINATED BONDS.DIGITAL REALTY TRUST - DIGITAL REALTY TRUST LP PRICED OFFERING OF EUR 500 MILLION OF EURO-DENOMINATED 1.125% GUARANTEED NOTES DUE 2028.'}{'symbol': 'DISCA', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'CANAL 1 REACHES CONTENT AND COMMERCIAL PARTNERSHIP DEAL WITH DISCOVERY COLOMBIA', 'text': 'HEMISPHERE MEDIA GROUP, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT CANAL 1, ONE OF THREE NATIONAL BROADCAST NETWORKS IN COLOMBIA, HAS ENTERED INTO A CONTENT AND COMMERCIAL PARTNERSHIP DEAL WITH THE LEADER IN REAL-LIFE ENTERTAINMENT, IN WHICH SOME OF DISCOVERY\'S MOST POPULAR PROGRAMS WILL AIR ON CANAL 1 DURING SELECT DAYPARTS THROUGHOUT THE WEEK. BEGINNING ON OCTOBER 7, COLOMBIAN AUDIENCES WILL GET TO ENJOY NEW PROGRAMMING ON CANAL 1 FEATURING SOME REAL-LIFE PROGRAMMING OVER-THE-AIR, MARKING THE FIRST TIME DISCOVERY PROGRAMMING WILL BE AVAILABLE ON BROADCAST TELEVISION IN COLOMBIA. THE NEW PROGRAMMING BLOCK, DUBBED \'ZONA DISCOVERY,\' WILL AIR MONDAY THROUGH FRIDAY FROM 12:30PM TO 2PM AND WILL FEATURE POPULAR SHOWS LIKE "THE MEDIUM" FROM TLC, AND "MY 600-LB LIFE," FROM DISCOVERY. ON OCTOBER 19, THE BLOCK WILL EXPAND TO WEEKENDS, WHEN CANAL 1 WILL PREMIERE THE HIGHLY POPULAR INVESTIGATION DISCOVERY SHOWS "WEB OF LIES" AND "YOUR WORST NIGHTMARE" FROM 2PM TO 4PM ON SATURDAYS AND SUNDAYS.'}{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'DUPONT DE NEMOURS, INC. (NYSE:DD) SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE EVOQUA WATER TECHNOLOGIES MEMBRANE SYSTEMS PTY LTD AND MEMCOR® PRODUCT LINE FROM EVOQUA WATER TECHNOLOGIES CORP. (NYSE:AQUA) AND OTHERS FOR $110 MILLION.', 'text': 'DUPONT DE NEMOURS, INC. (NYSE:DD) SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE EVOQUA WATER TECHNOLOGIES MEMBRANE SYSTEMS PTY LTD AND MEMCOR® PRODUCT LINE FROM EVOQUA WATER TECHNOLOGIES CORP. (NYSE:AQUA) AND OTHERS FOR $110 MILLION ON OCTOBER 1, 2019. THE CONSIDERATION IS SUBJECT TO CLOSING ADJUSTMENTS. THE TRANSACTION INCLUDES THE PURCHASE OF ALL OF THE SHARES OF EVOQUA WATER TECHNOLOGIES MEMBRANE SYSTEMS AND MEMCOR PRODUCT LINE’S GLOBAL WORKFORCE, ITS MANUFACTURING SITE IN WINDSOR, AUSTRALIA, ASSOCIATED OPERATIONS AND INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY. THE TRANSACTION IS SUBJECT TO THE ANY WAITING PERIODS AND ANY OTHER OBLIGATIONS, OR REQUIREMENTS APPLICABLE UNDER ANTITRUST LAWS OF THE JURISDICTIONS, SHALL HAVE EXPIRED OR BEEN COMPLIED WITH, AS APPLICABLE, OR EARLY TERMINATION THERE UNDER SHALL HAVE BEEN GRANTED, THE AUSTRALIAN COMPETITION AND CONSUMER COMMISSION SHALL HAVE INDICATED IN WRITING TO THE BUYER THAT IT DOES NOT PROPOSE TO INTERVENE IN THE ACQUISITION CONTEMPLATED BY THIS DOCUMENT PURSUANT TO SECTION 50 OF THE AUSTRALIA COMPETITION AND CONSUMER ACT 2010, ANY OTHER MATERIAL CONSENT, APPROVAL, CLEARANCE OR AUTHORIZATION OF ANY GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY, AND OTHER CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS. THE TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE BY THE END OF 2019. DARRICK M. MIX OF DUANE MORRIS LLP ACTED AS THE LEGAL ADVISOR TO DUPONT DE NEMOURS AND ROBERT P. ZINN OF K&L GATES LLP ACTED AS THE LEGAL ADVISOR TO ALL THE SELLERS AS PART OF THE TRANSACTION.\n'}{'symbol': 'EMN', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'EASTMAN CHEMICAL COMPANY, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 25, 2019', 'text': 'EASTMAN CHEMICAL COMPANY, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 25, 2019'}{'symbol': 'EBAY', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'EBAY INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 23, 2019', 'text': 'EBAY INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 23, 2019'}{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ECOLAB INC. (NYSE:ECL) ACQUIRED GALLAY MEDICAL & SCIENTIFIC PTY LTD.', 'text': 'ECOLAB INC. (NYSE:ECL) ACQUIRED GALLAY MEDICAL & SCIENTIFIC PTY LTD ON OCTOBER 3, 2019. FOR THE FISCAL YEAR ENDED JUNE 30, 2019, GALLAY MEDICAL & SCIENTIFIC PTY LTD HAS REPORTED SALES OF AUD 42 MILLION.\nECOLAB INC. (NYSE:ECL) COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF GALLAY MEDICAL & SCIENTIFIC PTY LTD ON OCTOBER 3, 2019. \n'}{'symbol': 'EW', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'EDWARDS LIFESCIENCES CORPORATION, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 23, 2019', 'text': 'EDWARDS LIFESCIENCES CORPORATION, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 23, 2019'}{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'EMERSON LAUNCHES ADVANCED INDUSTRIAL WIRELESS NETWORK SOLUTION', 'text': "EMERSON IS PARTNERING WITH CISCO TO INTRODUCE A NEXT-GENERATION INDUSTRIAL WIRELESS NETWORKING SOLUTION THAT FUNDAMENTALLY TRANSFORMS DATA MANAGEMENT TO IMPROVE PLANT PRODUCTIVITY, RELIABILITY AND SAFETY. THE NEW EMERSON WIRELESS 1410S GATEWAY WITH THE CISCO CATALYST® IW6300 HEAVY DUTY SERIES ACCESS POINT COMBINES THE LATEST IN WIRELESS TECHNOLOGY WITH ADVANCED WIRELESSHART® SENSOR TECHNOLOGY, DELIVERING RELIABLE AND HIGHLY SECURE DATA, EVEN IN THE HARSHEST INDUSTRIAL ENVIRONMENTS. TO HELP ENABLE NEW DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION STRATEGIES, THIS INDUSTRIAL NETWORKING SOLUTION COMBINES EMERSON'S EXPERTISE IN INDUSTRIAL AUTOMATION AND APPLICATIONS WITH CISCO'S INNOVATIONS IN NETWORKING, CYBERSECURITY AND IT INFRASTRUCTURE. DRIVEN BY THE DEMAND FOR GREATER PRODUCTIVITY, LOWER MAINTENANCE COSTS AND IMPROVED WORKER SAFETY, INDUSTRIAL MANUFACTURERS ARE ACCELERATING INVESTMENT IN ROBUST IOT SENSOR NETWORKS COMBINED WITH SCALABLE OPERATIONAL ANALYTICS TOOLS TO IMPROVE ORGANIZATIONAL COLLABORATION AND DECISION MAKING. IN THESE ENVIRONMENTS, NETWORK PERFORMANCE AND SECURITY ARE CRITICAL FOR SUCCESS."}{'symbol': 'ENPH', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ENPHASE ENERGY CONTRIBUTES TO HIGHER QUALITY INSPECTION SCORES FOR LIGHTHOUSE SOLAR', 'text': 'ENPHASE ENERGY INC. ANNOUNCED THAT LIGHTHOUSE SOLAR CONSISTENTLY ACHIEVES HIGHER QUALITY ASSURANCE SCORES FROM THE NEW YORK STATE ENERGY RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY (NYSERDA) IN PART BY USING ENPHASE’S MICROINVERTER-BASED SYSTEMS. THROUGH ITS NY-SUN INCENTIVE PROGRAM, NYSERDA OPERATES A SOLAR INSTALLER QUALITY ASSURANCE (QA) PROGRAM. THE QUALITY SOLAR INSTALLER DESIGNATION IS PROVIDED TO INSTALLERS WHO ARE IN GOOD STANDING AND HAVE ACHIEVED AN AVERAGE QA INSPECTION SCORE OF 4.0 OR BETTER OUT 5.0 FOR THE PREVIOUS CALENDAR YEAR. THE DESIGNATION SERVES TO RECOGNIZE THOSE INSTALLERS WHO HAVE CONSISTENTLY DELIVERED PROJECTS THAT MEET THE HIGH STANDARDS OF QUALITY AND MOTIVATE THOSE INSTALLERS WHO HAVE NOT ACHIEVED THIS DESIGNATION TO PERFORM BETTER.'}{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'EQUINIX, INC. (REIT), Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 30, 2019', 'text': 'EQUINIX, INC. (REIT), Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 30, 2019'}{'symbol': 'FISV', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'NOVO BANCO SELECTS FISERV, INC. TO MODERNIZE PAYMENTS PROCESSING', 'text': 'FISERV, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT PORTUGUESE BANK, NOVO BANCO, WILL CONSOLIDATE THEIR EXISTING PAYMENTS INFRASTRUCTURE AND DEPLOY END-TO-END BILLING AND PAYMENT CAPABILITIES USING TECHNOLOGY FROM FISERV. THIS INITIATIVE, UNDERTAKEN AS PART OF THE BANK’S OVERALL IT AND PAYMENTS TRANSFORMATION PROGRAM, WILL ALLOW THE BANK TO DECOMMISSION MULTIPLE INFLEXIBLE LEGACY SYSTEMS AND BUILD AN EFFICIENT, SCALABLE MODERN PAYMENTS ARCHITECTURE. NOVO BANCO WILL USE ENTERPRISE PAYMENTS PLATFORM, FORMERLY DOVETAIL, FOR ALL PAYMENTS PROCESSING AND ADVANTAGE FEETM, A COMPREHENSIVE BILLING AND REVENUE MANAGEMENT SOLUTION, FOR NOSTRO AND CORRESPONDENT BANKING CHARGING. THE FISERV TECHNOLOGY WILL INTEGRATE WITH OTHER SYSTEMS WITHIN THE BANK, INCLUDING ANTI-MONEY LAUNDERING (AML), FRAUD, RISK AND CORE BANKING PLATFORMS, AND EXTERNALLY WITH OTHER NOVO BANCO ENTITIES. ENTERPRISE PAYMENTS PLATFORM WILL ENABLE CENTRALIZED MANAGEMENT OF ALL NOVO BANCO PAYMENTS, REGARDLESS OF THE ORIGINATION CHANNEL, PAYMENT TYPE AND ENTITY. THE BANK WILL MOVE ALL HIGH-VALUE PAYMENTS INCLUDING SWIFT, SWIFT GPI AND SIBS TARGET2 TO THE ENTERPRISE PAYMENTS PLATFORM IMMEDIATELY, FOLLOWED BY LOW-VALUE AND INSTANT PAYMENT TYPES.'}{'symbol': 'FLT', 'date': '2019-10-02 10:30:00', 'title': 'FLEETCOR ACQUIRES TRAVELLIANCE', 'text': 'FLEETCOR ACQUIRES TRAVELLIANCE, A LEADER IN AIRLINE LODGING PROGRAMS.'}{'symbol': 'FMC', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'CITIGROUP INC., CITIGROUP’S 2019 BASIC MATERIALS CONFERENCE 2019, DEC 03, 2019 THROUGH DEC 04, 2019', 'text': 'CITIGROUP INC., CITIGROUP’S 2019 BASIC MATERIALS CONFERENCE 2019, DEC 03, 2019 THROUGH DEC 04, 2019. VENUE: THE WAGNER AT THE BATTERY, NEW YORK, NEW YORK, UNITED STATES.'}{'symbol': 'FTV', 'date': '2019-10-02 12:30:00', 'title': 'GILBARCO VEEDER-ROOT ENABLES PAYMENT OPTIONS FOR EV CHARGING', 'text': 'ANNOUNCED AVAILABILITY OF PAYMENT OPTIONS FOR VEEFIL RT-50KW EV CHARGERS MANUFACTURED BY TRITIUM.'}{'symbol': 'GPS', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'THE GAP, INC. PRESENTS AT CONNECT 2019, OCT-07-2019 01:30 PM', 'text': 'THE GAP, INC. PRESENTS AT CONNECT 2019, OCT-07-2019 01:30 PM. VENUE: LOEWS CHICAGO - DOWNTOWN, 455 N PARK DR. CHICAGO, CHICAGO, ILLINOIS, UNITED STATES. SPEAKERS: EMILY TAYLOR, DIRECTOR, PRODUCT MANAGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'IT', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'GARTNER, INC. PRESENTS AT GARTNER IT SYMPOSIUM/XPO - GOLD COAST, OCT-28-2019 THROUGH OCT-31-2019', 'text': 'GARTNER, INC. PRESENTS AT GARTNER IT SYMPOSIUM/XPO - GOLD COAST, OCT-28-2019 THROUGH OCT-31-2019. VENUE: GOLD COAST CONVENTION AND EXHIBITION CENTRE, CNR GOLD COAST HIGHWAY & TE PETERS DRIVE, BROADBEACH, GOLD COAST, QUEENSLAND, AUSTRALIA. PRESENTATION DATE & SPEAKERS: OCT-28-2019, ASH SOWTER, SR EXECUTIVE PARTNER, CATHLEEN BLANTON, VP ANALYS, CATHLEEN BLANTON, VP ANALYST, DEAN LACHECA, SR DIRECTOR ANALYST, DOUGLAS R. MORRISON, MVP EVENT PRODUCTION, ETHAN COHEN, SR DIRECTOR ANALYST, FRANK ZENKE, EXECUTIVE PARTNER, KEITH HARRISON, MANAGING VP, KELLY CALHOUN WILLIAMS, VP ANALYST, LAURA CRAF, VP ANALYST, LAURA CRAFT, VP ANALYST, MARCUS DARBYSHIRE, V