VP ANALYST, DAVID FURLONGER, DISTINGUISHED VP ANALYST, DEACON D. K. WAN, SR. DIRECTOR ANALYST, DIANE BERRY, VP ANALYST, ED THOMPSON, DISTINGUISHED VP ANALYST, GRAHAM WALLER, DISTINGUISHED VP ANALYST, JAMES ANDERSON, SR. DIRECTOR ANALYST, JASON WONG, VP ANALYST, LEIGH MCMULLEN, DISTINGUISHED VP ANALYST, NERIDA BUDD, BUDD, OWEN CHEN, SR. DIRECTOR ANALYST, PARTHA IYENGAR, DISTINGUISHED VP ANALYST, PAUL PROCTOR, DISTINGUISHED VP ANALYST, SAUL BRAND, SR. DIRECTOR ANALYST, SHAILESH MUVERA KUTTAPPA, SR. PRINCIPAL ADVISORY, SRINATH SAMPATH, SR. DIRECTOR ANALYST, STEFAN KULAK, DIRECTOR ADVISORY, SUZANNE ADNAMS, VP ANALYST, YOSHI MATSUMOTO, VP ADVISORY.'}{'symbol': 'GIS', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'GENERAL MILLS, INC. PRESENTS AT GLOBAL PROTEIN SUMMIT, OCT-07-2019 03:30 PM', 'text': 'GENERAL MILLS, INC. PRESENTS AT GLOBAL PROTEIN SUMMIT, OCT-07-2019 03:30 PM. VENUE: INTERCONTINENTAL MAGNIFICENT, CHICAGO, ILLINOIS, UNITED STATES. SPEAKERS: AARON RIIPPA, SOURCING MANAGER; PROTEIN.'}{'symbol': 'GILD', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'GILEAD SCIENCES, INC. ANNOUNCES U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION APPROVES DESCOVY® FOR HIV PRE-EXPOSURE PROPHYLAXIS (PREP)', 'text': 'GILEAD SCIENCES, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) APPROVED A PRE-EXPOSURE PROPHYLAXIS (PREP) INDICATION FOR DESCOVY (EMTRICITABINE 200 MG AND TENOFOVIR ALAFENAMIDE 25 MG TABLETS; F/TAF). DESCOVY FOR PREP™ IS INDICATED TO REDUCE THE RISK OF SEXUALLY ACQUIRED HIV-1 INFECTION IN ADULTS AND ADOLESCENTS WEIGHING AT LEAST 35 KG WHO ARE HIV-NEGATIVE AND AT-RISK FOR SEXUALLY ACQUIRED HIV, EXCLUDING INDIVIDUALS AT-RISK FROM RECEPTIVE VAGINAL SEX. THE FDA APPROVED THE SUPPLEMENTAL NEW DRUG APPLICATION (SNDA) FOR DESCOVY UNDER A PRIORITY REVIEW DESIGNATION. DESCOVY HAS A BOXED WARNING IN ITS U.S. PRODUCT LABEL REGARDING THE RISK OF POST TREATMENT ACUTE EXACERBATION OF HEPATITIS B. THE DESCOVY LABEL ALSO INCLUDES A BOXED WARNING REGARDING THE RISK OF DRUG RESISTANCE WITH PREP USE IN UNDIAGNOSED EARLY HIV-1 INFECTION. THE EFFECTIVENESS OF DESCOVY FOR PREP IN INDIVIDUALS AT RISK OF HIV-1 FROM RECEPTIVE VAGINAL SEX HAS NOT BEEN ESTABLISHED. THE APPROVAL OF A PREP INDICATION FOR DESCOVY, TAKEN ONCE DAILY WITH OR WITHOUT FOOD IN PATIENTS WEIGHING AT LEAST 35 KG, IS BASED ON DATA FROM THE DISCOVER TRIAL, A MULTI-YEAR GLOBAL PHASE 3 REGISTRATIONAL CLINICAL TRIAL THAT EVALUATED THE SAFETY AND EFFICACY OF DESCOVY FOR PREP COMPARED WITH THAT OF TRUVADA (EMTRICITABINE 200 MG AND TENOFOVIR DISOPROXIL FUMARATE 300 MG TABLETS; F/TDF) FOR PREP® IN REDUCING THE RISK OF ACQUIRING HIV-1 INFECTION. ENROLLMENT INCLUDED MORE THAN 5,300 ADULT CISGENDER MEN WHO HAVE SEX WITH MEN OR TRANSGENDER WOMEN (TGW) WHO HAVE SEX WITH MEN. THE PRIMARY EFFICACY ENDPOINT OF DISCOVER WAS THE INCIDENCE OF DOCUMENTED HIV INFECTION PER 100 PERSON-YEARS AFTER ALL PARTICIPANTS HAD FOLLOW-UP OF AT LEAST 48 WEEKS AND AT LEAST HALF HAD 96 WEEKS OF FOLLOW-UP. THESE DATA, WHICH WERE PRESENTED IN MARCH AT THE 2019 CONFERENCE ON RETROVIRUSES AND OPPORTUNISTIC INFECTIONS (CROI), INCLUDED 5,387 INDIVIDUALS WHO WERE RANDOMIZED 1:1 TO RECEIVE EITHER DESCOVY OR TRUVADA. AMONG THE 2,694 PARTICIPANTS (4,370 PERSON-YEARS (PY)) WHO WERE AT RISK OF HIV-1 INFECTION AND RECEIVED ONCE-DAILY DESCOVY, SEVEN HIV-1 INFECTIONS (HIV-1 INCIDENCE 0.16/100 PY) WERE REPORTED. AMONG THE 2,693 PARTICIPANTS (4,386 PY) WHO WERE AT RISK OF HIV-1 INFECTION AND RECEIVED TRUVADA, 15 HIV INFECTIONS (0.34/100 PY) WERE REPORTED. RESULTS FROM THE DISCOVER TRIAL DEMONSTRATED THAT DESCOVY ACHIEVED NON-INFERIORITY TO TRUVADA IN STUDY PARTICIPANTS WHO WERE AT RISK OF HIV ACQUISITION. EFFICACY WAS STRONGLY CORRELATED TO ADHERENCE TO DAILY DOSING.'}{'symbol': 'HAL', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'HALLIBURTON COMPANY PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-09-2019 03:15 PM', 'text': 'HALLIBURTON COMPANY PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-09-2019 03:15 PM. VENUE: DUBAI, UNITED ARAB EMIRATES. SPEAKERS: SATYAM PRIYADARSHY, CHIEF DATA SCIENTIST.'}{'symbol': 'HCA', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'HCA HEALTHCARE, INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 29, 2019', 'text': 'HCA HEALTHCARE, INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 29, 2019'}{'symbol': 'PEAK', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'HCP, INC. TO REPORT Q3, 2019 RESULTS ON OCT 30, 2019', 'text': 'HCP, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT THEY WILL REPORT Q3, 2019 RESULTS AT 5:00 PM, EASTERN STANDARD TIME ON OCT 30, 2019'}{'symbol': 'HD', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'THE HOME DEPOT, INC. PRESENTS AT CONNECT 2019, OCT-08-2019 09:15 AM', 'text': 'THE HOME DEPOT, INC. PRESENTS AT CONNECT 2019, OCT-08-2019 09:15 AM. VENUE: LOEWS CHICAGO - DOWNTOWN, 455 N PARK DR. CHICAGO, CHICAGO, ILLINOIS, UNITED STATES. SPEAKERS: JOE AMOROSSO, DIRECTOR, ENTERPRISE ITEM DATA MANAGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL INTERNATIONAL INC. ANNOUNCES NEW HEADQUARTERS BUILDING IN CHARLOTTE', 'text': "HONEYWELL INTERNATIONAL INC. ANNOUNCED ITS NEW CHARLOTTE HEADQUARTERS IN UPTOWN, A MOVE THAT THE COMPANY'S TOP EXECUTIVE HOPES WILL BE THE FIRST OF MANY BUILDINGS FOR THE COMPANY IN THE QUEEN CITY. CONSIDERED A HUGE COUP FOR CHARLOTTE, GIVEN HONEYWELL'S STATURE, THE DECISION FOR THE ELECTRONICS MANUFACTURER TO RELOCATE TO CHARLOTTE WAS INITIALLY HARD BUT NOW HAS COMPANY EMPLOYEES EXCITED. THE COMPANY WILL LEASE ABOUT 280,000 SQUARE FEET AT A 23-STORY OFFICE TOWER AT THE LEGACY UNION SITE IN UPTOWN, WHICH CHARLOTTE-BASED LINCOLN HARRIS IS DEVELOPING WITH GOLDMAN SACHS. HONEYWELL BEGAN MOVING INTO ITS TEMPORARY HEADQUARTERS OFFICE SPACE AT 300 SOUTH TRYON THIS SUMMER. THE BUILDING AT LEGACY UNION WILL DELIVER IN THE FIRST HALF OF 2021, WITH A GOAL OF HONEYWELL MOVING IN THAT SUMMER."}{'symbol': 'HPQ', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'HP INC. PROVIDES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FISCAL 2020', 'text': 'HP INC. PROVIDED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FISCAL 2020. FOR FISCAL 2020, THE COMPANY ESTIMATES GAAP DILUTED NET EPS TO BE IN THE RANGE OF $1.98 TO $2.10.'}{'symbol': 'ITW', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 25, 2019', 'text': 'ILLINOIS TOOL WORKS INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 25, 2019'}{'symbol': 'IR', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'INGERSOLL-RAND PLC DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS FOR INGERSOLL-RAND PLC DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.53 CENTS PER ORDINARY SHARE, PAYABLE DECEMBER 31, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON DECEMBER 6, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ENEA PARTNERS WITH FLEXIWAN AND INTEL FOR OPEN SOURCE, SECURE SD-WAN', 'text': 'ENEA ANNOUNCED A JOINT PROOF OF CONCEPT (POC) WITH FLEXIWAN AND INTEL, DEMONSTRATING A REFERENCE SOLUTION FOR SECURE SD-WAN BASED ON OPEN SOURCE APPLICATIONS. IT WILL BE SHOWCASED AT THE SDN NFV WORLD CONGRESS IN THE HAGUE, OCTOBER 14-17. COMMUNICATION SERVICE PROVIDERS AND ENTERPRISES ARE LOOKING FOR WAYS TO INNOVATE AND INCREASE FLEXIBILITY OF THEIR SD-WAN SOLUTIONS. THIS CAN BE ACHIEVED BY COMBINING WHITE BOX UCPE APPLIANCES WITH OPEN SOURCE APPLICATIONS RUNNING AS VIRTUAL NETWORK FUNCTIONS (VNFS). AN OPEN SOLUTION FACILITATES INNOVATION FOR VNF VENDORS AND ENTERPRISES BUILDING THEIR OWN APPLICATIONS, AS IT ENABLES INTEGRATION WITH FULL CONTROL OF THE CODE BASE, AND IS NOT DEPENDENT ON ANY COMMERCIAL SOFTWARE VENDOR`S ROADMAP. THE JOINT SOLUTION DEMONSTRATES A SECURE, MULTI-VENDOR, SD-WAN DEPLOYMENT WITH SERVICE-CHAINED, OPEN SOURCE SD-WAN AND SECURITY VNFS, WHITE BOX HARDWARE AND AN OPEN VIRTUALIZATION AND MANAGEMENT PLATFORM. IT INCLUDES THE FOLLOWING MAIN COMPONENTS: FLEXIWAN: A CENTRALLY-MANAGED SD-WAN OPEN SOURCE VNF WITH INTEGRATION POINTS FOR THIRD PARTY LOGIC, PFSENSE: AN OPEN SOURCE FIREWALL AND NETWORK SECURITY VNF, · ENEA NFV ACCESS: A UCPE VIRTUALIZATION PLATFORM, OPTIMIZED FOR SD-WAN AND VCPE USE CASES, ENEA UCPE MANAGER: CENTRALIZED UCPE MANAGEMENT WITH AUTOMATION, LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT VIM, AND VNF MANAGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-07-2019 03:30 PM', 'text': 'INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-07-2019 03:30 PM. VENUE: DUBAI, UNITED ARAB EMIRATES. SPEAKERS: SUSAN JAIN, CMO (MIDDLE EAST & AFRICA).'}{'symbol': 'IP', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'INTERNATIONAL PAPER COMPANY PRESENTS AT STEPHENS NASHVILLE INVESTMENT CONFERENCE, NOV-13-2019', 'text': 'INTERNATIONAL PAPER COMPANY PRESENTS AT STEPHENS NASHVILLE INVESTMENT CONFERENCE, NOV-13-2019 . VENUE: OMNI NASHVILLE HOTEL, 250 FIFTH AVENUE S, NASHVILLE, TENNESSEE, UNITED STATES. SPEAKERS: GUILLERMO GUTIERREZ, VICE PRESIDENT OF INVESTOR RELATIONS.'}{'symbol': 'INTU', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'INTUIT INC. PROVIDES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FIRST-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR FISCAL 2020', 'text': 'INTUIT INC. PROVIDED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FIRST-QUARTER AND FULL-YEAR FISCAL 2020. FOR THE FIRST QUARTER, THE COMPANY EXPECTS REVENUE OF $1.105 BILLION TO $1.125 BILLION, GROWTH OF 9% TO 11%, OPERATING LOSS OF $40 MILLION TO $50 MILLION AND LOSS PER SHARE OF $0.02 TO $0.04. FOR THE YEAR, THE COMPANY EXPECTS REVENUE OF $7.440 BILLION TO $7.540 BILLION, GROWTH OF 10% TO 11%, OPERATING INCOME OF $2.065 BILLION TO $2.115 BILLION, GROWTH OF 11% TO 14% AND DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $6.35 TO $6.45, GROWTH OF 8% TO 10%.'}{'symbol': 'IRM', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'IRON MOUNTAIN INCORPORATED, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 31, 2019', 'text': 'IRON MOUNTAIN INCORPORATED, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 31, 2019'}{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'JACOBS TO DELIVER PROGRAM MANAGEMENT SERVICES FOR NEW MANILA INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT', 'text': "JACOBS ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN SELECTED BY SAN MIGUEL CORPORATION AS PROGRAM MANAGEMENT CONSULTANT FOR THE NEW MANILA INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT PROJECT IN BULACAN, THE PHILIPPINES. THE ENTIRE DEVELOPMENT INCLUDES CONSTRUCTION OF A NEW TERMINAL, FOUR RUNWAYS AND AIRPORT SUPPORT FACILITIES SPREAD OUT OVER ALMOST 6,200 ACRES (2,500 HECTARES) IN THE PROVINCE OF BULACAN. WHEN COMPLETE, THE AIRPORT WILL ACCOMMODATE UP TO 100 MILLION PASSENGERS PER YEAR AND WILL SIGNIFICANTLY EASE PASSENGER AND AIR TRAFFIC CONGESTION AT MANILA'S EXISTING NINOY AQUINO INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT. SMC IS INVESTING APPROXIMATELY USD 14 BILLION (PHP 734 BILLION) INTO THE PROJECT WITH THE FIRST PHASE TO BE OPERATIONAL WITHIN SIX YEARS. PROGRAM MANAGEMENT SERVICES TO BE DELIVERED BY JACOBS DURING PLANNING, DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION PHASES INCLUDE PROJECT SCOPING AND MANAGEMENT, CONTRACT DEVELOPMENT, STRATEGIC ADVISORY, DESIGN MANAGEMENT AND SCHEDULING AND FINANCIAL PLANNING."}{'symbol': 'SJM', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'THE J. M. SMUCKER COMPANY ISSUES VOLUNTARY RECALL OF SPECIFIC LOTS OF ROBIN HOOD® ALL PURPOSE FLOUR DISTRIBUTED AND SOLD IN THE U.S. ONLY', 'text': 'THE J. M. SMUCKER COMPANY ANNOUNCED A VOLUNTARY RECALL OF SPECIFIC LOTS OF ROBIN HOOD® ALL PURPOSE FLOUR DISTRIBUTED AND SOLD IN THE U.S. DUE TO POSSIBLE E. COLI CONTAMINATION. THIS RECALL DOES NOT IMPACT ANY ROBIN HOOD® ITEMS SOLD IN CANADA. NO OTHER ITEMS MANUFACTURED BY THE J. M. SMUCKER COMPANY, INCLUDING OTHER ROBIN HOOD® PRODUCTS DISTRIBUTED AND SOLD IN THE U.S. OR CANADA, ARE IMPACTED BY THIS ISSUE. NO ILLNESSES RELATED TO THIS ISSUE HAVE BEEN REPORTED TO DATE.'}{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON PRESENTS AT DISRUPT SF 2019, OCT-03-2019 09:35 AM', 'text': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON PRESENTS AT DISRUPT SF 2019, OCT-03-2019 09:35 AM. VENUE: MOSCONE NORTH CONVENTION CENTER, 730 HOWARD ST, SAN FRANCICSO, CALIFORNIA, UNITED STATES. SPEAKERS: FRED MOLL, CHIEF DEVELOPMENT OFFICER DIGITAL SURGERY GROUP.'}{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2019-10-02 18:30:00', 'title': 'KROGER IS LAYING OFF HUNDREDS OF STORE EMPLOYEES - BUSINESS INSIDER', 'text': ':KROGER IS LAYING OFF HUNDREDS OF STORE EMPLOYEES'}{'symbol': 'LW', 'date': '2019-10-02 10:30:00', 'title': 'LAMB WESTON REPORTS Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.79', 'text': 'LAMB WESTON REPORTS FISCAL FIRST QUARTER 2020 RESULTS; REAFFIRMS FISCAL YEAR 2020 OUTLOOK.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.79.Q1 SALES $989 MILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $971.4 MILLION.Q1 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.79 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.LAMB WESTON - INCREASED ITS TARGET FOR FISCAL 2020 CAPEX TO ABOUT $300 MILLION FROM ABOUT $275 MILLION.'}{'symbol': 'LVS', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'LAS VEGAS SANDS CORP.(NYSE:LVS) ADDED TO S&P 500', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS SANDS CORP.(NYSE:LVS) ADDED TO S&P 500'}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'LEIDOS JOINS THE SCALED AGILE PARTNER NETWORK AS A GOLD PARTNER', 'text': "LEIDOS ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS JOINED THE SCALED AGILE PARTNER NETWORK AS A GOLD TRANSFORMATION PARTNER. THIS WORLDWIDE NETWORK INCLUDES TRANSFORMATION AND PLATFORM PROVIDERS WHO HELP ENTERPRISES FACILITATE AND ACCELERATE BUSINESS RESULTS THROUGH ADOPTION OF THE SCALED AGILE FRAMEWORK (SAFE). AS THE WORLD'S LEADING FRAMEWORK FOR ENTERPRISE AGILITY, SAFE HELPS BUSINESSES ADDRESS THE SIGNIFICANT CHALLENGES OF DEVELOPING AND DELIVERING HIGH-QUALITY SOFTWARE AND SYSTEMS IN THE SHORTEST SUSTAINABLE LEAD-TIME."}{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'LENNAR CORPORATION ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 1, 2019', 'text': 'LENNAR CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.04 PER SHARE FOR BOTH CLASS A AND CLASS B COMMON STOCK PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 1, 2019 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OFBUSINESS ON OCTOBER 18, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2019-10-02 14:30:00', 'title': 'LENNAR SAYS HOUSING MARKET SEEMS SOLID AND STRONG, CONTINUES TO IMPROVE', 'text': '(OFFICIAL)-LENNAR CORP EXPECTS Q4 DELIVERIES BETWEEN 15,800 HOMES TO 16,000 HOMES (NOT 18,500 HOMES TO 16,000 HOMES).LENNAR CORP EXPECTS Q4 DELIVERIES TO BE BETWEEN 15,800 TO 16,000 HOMES.LENNAR CORP - COMBINATION OF LOWER INTEREST RATES, SLOWER PRICE DEPRECIATION POSITIVELY IMPACTED AFFORDABILITY STRENGTHENING Q3 SALES - CONF CALL.LENNAR CORP - NOT GIVING SPECIFIC GUIDANCE FOR 2020 AT THIS TIME BUT OPTIMISTIC ABOUT THE PROSPECTS FOR NEXT YEAR - CONF CALL.LENNAR CORP - ENTRY LEVEL MARKET ACCOUNTS FOR ABOUT 40% OF BUSINESS, WILL CONTINUE TO INCREASE AS MORE FIRST TIME BUYER COMMUNITIES COME ONLINE.LENNAR CORP - Q3 2019 GROSS MARGINS WERE IMPACTED BY LOWER AVERAGE SALES PRICES AS WE TARGET MORE FIRST-TIME HOMEBUYERS, LOWER-PRICED HOMES.LENNAR CORP EXPECTS Q4 GROSS MARGIN TO BE IN THE RANGE OF 21.25% TO 21.5% AND SG&A TO BE IN THE RANGE OF 7.7% TO 7.8%.LENNAR CORP EXPECTS Q4 NEW ORDERS TO BE BETWEEN 12,200 AND 12,400 HOMES.LENNAR CORP SAYS ON UPCOMING POTENTIAL RECESSION, HOUSING MARKET IN GENERAL SEEMS SOLID AND STRONG AND CONTINUES TO IMPROVE.'}{'symbol': 'LEN', 'date': '2019-10-02 08:30:00', 'title': 'LENNAR CORP POSTS Q3 REVENUE OF $5.9 BILLION', 'text': 'LENNAR REPORTS THIRD QUARTER EPS OF $1.59.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.59.Q3 REVENUE $5.9 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $5.48 BILLION.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $1.32 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QUARTER-END BACKLOG OF 18,908 HOMES - DOWN 2%.QUARTER-END BACKLOG DOLLAR VALUE OF $7.6 BILLION - DOWN 9%.REVENUES FROM HOME SALES INCREASED 2% IN Q3 OF 2019 TO $5.3 BILLION FROM $5.2 BILLION IN Q3 OF 2018.QTRLY DELIVERIES OF 13,522 HOMES, UP 7%.QUARTER-END DELIVERIES OF 13,522 HOMES - UP 7%.NEW HOME DELIVERIES, EXCLUDING UNCONSOLIDATED ENTITIES, INCREASED TO 13,513 HOMES IN Q3 OF 2019 FROM 12,600 HOMES.AVERAGE SALES PRICE OF HOMES DELIVERED WAS $394,000 IN Q3 OF 2019, COMPARED TO $415,000.QTRLY NEW ORDERS OF 13,369 HOMES - UP 9%; NEW ORDERS DOLLAR VALUE OF $5.2 BILLION - UP 3%.LENNAR - CONTINUE TO BELIEVE BASIC UNDERLYING HOUSING MARKET FUNDAMENTALS OF LOW UNEMPLOYMENT, HIGHER WAGES AND LOW INVENTORY LEVELS REMAIN FAVORABLE.'}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'ELI LILLY AND COMPANY PRESENTS DETAILED DATA AT THE 5TH ANNUAL MAUI DERM NP+PA FALL MEETING FROM THE PHASE 4 IXORA-R STUDY', 'text': "ELI LILLY AND COMPANY PRESENTED DETAILED DATA AT THE 5TH ANNUAL MAUI DERM NP+PA FALL MEETING FROM THE PHASE 4 IXORA-R STUDY, THE FIRST HEAD-TO-HEAD (H2H) STUDY BETWEEN AN IL-17A INHIBITOR AND AN IL-23/P19 INHIBITOR USING THE PSORIASIS AREA SEVERITY INDEX (PASI) 100 SCORE AS THE PRIMARY ENDPOINT. TALTZ MET THE PRIMARY ENDPOINT OF SUPERIORITY VS. TREMFYA IN THE PROPORTION OF PATIENTS WITH MODERATE TO SEVERE PLAQUE PSORIASIS ACHIEVING COMPLETE SKIN CLEARANCE AS MEASURED BY PASI 100 AT WEEK 12, AS WELL AS KEY SECONDARY ENDPOINTS. THE PRIMARY ENDPOINT OF THE STUDY WAS SUPERIORITY FOR TALTZ COMPARED TO TREMFYA IN THE PROPORTION OF PATIENTS ACHIEVING COMPLETE SKIN CLEARANCE AS MEASURED BY PASI 100 AT WEEK 12. KEY SECONDARY ENDPOINTS INCLUDED SUPERIORITY OVER TREMFYA IN THE PROPORTION OF PATIENTS ACHIEVING PASI 75 AT WEEK 2, PASI 90 AT WEEKS 4 AND 8, PASI 100 AT WEEKS 4, 8 AND 24, STATIC PHYSICIAN'S GLOBAL ASSESSMENT (SPGA) 0 AT WEEK 12 AND PASI 50 AT WEEK 1. PATIENTS TREATED WITH TALTZ DEMONSTRATED STATISTICALLY SIGNIFICANTLY HIGHER IMPROVEMENTS THAN THOSE TREATED WITH TREMFYA AS MEASURED BY PASI 100 AT WEEK 12 (41.3% VERSUS 24.9%, P<0.001). ADDITIONALLY, ALL MAJOR SECONDARY ENDPOINTS UP TO WEEK 12 WERE ACHIEVED (P<0.001). A TOTAL OF 1,027 PATIENTS WITH MODERATE TO SEVERE PLAQUE PSORIASIS WERE ENROLLED IN THE STUDY TO EVALUATE THE EFFICACY AND SAFETY OF TALTZ COMPARED TO TREMFYA. PARTICIPANTS WERE RANDOMIZED TO RECEIVE TALTZ OR TREMFYA AT THE APPROVED DOSE FOR A TOTAL OF 24 WEEKS, WITH THE PRIMARY ANALYSIS CONDUCTED AT 12 WEEKS. IN IXORA-R, THE SAFETY PROFILES OF TALTZ AND TREMFYA WERE CONSISTENT WITH THOSE PREVIOUSLY REPORTED FOR BOTH TREATMENTS. AS THE IXORA-R STUDY IS ONGOING, NOT ALL DATA WILL BE PRESENTED AT THIS MEETING TO PREVENT UNBLINDING FOR INVESTIGATORS AND PARTICIPANTS. LILLY PLANS TO SHARE RESULTS ON THE REMAINING KEY SECONDARY ENDPOINT OF PROPORTION OF PATIENTS ACHIEVING PASI 100 AT 24 WEEKS IN 2020."}{'symbol': 'LYV', 'date': '2019-10-02 19:30:00', 'title': 'LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT ANNOUNCES PRICING OF PRIVATE NOTES OFFERING', 'text': 'LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT ANNOUNCES PRICING OF PRIVATE NOTES OFFERING.LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT INC - PRICED AN OFFERING OF $950 MILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 4.75% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2027.LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT INC - SENIOR NOTES WERE PRICED AT 100.000% OF THEIR PRINCIPAL AMOUNT.'}{'symbol': 'LYV', 'date': '2019-10-02 14:30:00', 'title': 'LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT ANNOUNCES LAUNCH OF PRIVATE NOTES OFFERING', 'text': 'LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT ANNOUNCES LAUNCH OF PRIVATE NOTES OFFERING.LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT INC - INTENDS TO OFFER $950 MILLION OF ITS SENIOR NOTES DUE 2027.LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT - CONCURRENTLY WITH ISSUANCE OF SENIOR NOTES, CO INTENDS TO ENTER AMENDMENT TO EXISTING SENIOR SECURED CREDIT FACILITY.LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT - TO USE PROCEEDS,BORROWINGS UNDER NEW CREDIT FACILITY, TO REDEEM 5.375% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2022.LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT - TO ALSO USE PROCEEDS, BORROWINGS UNDER NEW CREDIT FACILITY, TO REPAY BORROWINGS UNDER ITS EXISTING CREDIT FACILITY.'}{'symbol': 'LKQ', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'LKQ CORPORATION ANNOUNCES BOARD CHANGES', 'text': "LKQ CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS APPOINTED PATRICK BERARD TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 2, 2019, AS PART OF THE BOARD'S ONGOING REFRESHMENT PROCESS. MR. BERARD IS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF PARIS-BASED REXEL GROUP, A WORLDWIDE EXPERT IN THE MULTICHANNEL PROFESSIONAL DISTRIBUTION OF PRODUCTS AND SERVICES FOR THE ENERGY WORLD. LKQ ALSO ANNOUNCED THAT A. CLINTON ALLEN AND WILLIAM M. WEBSTER, IV HAVE DECIDED THAT THEY WILL RETIRE FROM THE BOARD WHEN THEIR TERMS EXPIRE IN CONNECTION WITH THE COMPANY'S 2020 ANNUAL MEETING."}{'symbol': 'MPC', 'date': '2019-10-02 14:30:00', 'title': 'THE ANDERSONS AND MARATHON PETROLEUM COMBINE ETHANOL INTERESTS', 'text': "THE ANDERSONS, INC. AND MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP. COMBINE ETHANOL INTERESTS.ANDERSONS INC - ANDERSONS AND MARATHON PETROLEUM OWN 50.1% AND 49.9% OF TAMH EQUITY, RESPECTIVELY.ANDERSONS INC - WILL CONTINUE TO OPERATE FOUR PLANTS, BUY CORN, MARKET ETHANOL AND OTHER COPRODUCTS AND MANAGE RISK FOR TAMH.ANDERSONS INC - IN CONJUNCTION WITH MERGER AGREEMENT, TAMH HAS ENTERED INTO SEVERAL NEW LONG-TERM SERVICES AGREEMENTS WITH ANDERSONS.ANDERSONS INC - TAMH HAS ENTERED INTO SEVERAL NEW LONG-TERM SERVICES AGREEMENTS WITH ANDERSONS.ANDERSONS INC - DEBT PREVIOUSLY HELD BY SEPARATE ENTITIES WAS REFINANCED USING A NEW $200 MILLION TAMH CREDIT FACILITY.ANDERSONS - MERGER WILL RESULT IN SIZABLE ONE-TIME, NONCASH GAIN IN Q4.ANDERSONS INC - CO, MARATHON PETROLEUM MERGED FOUR ETHANOL ENTITIES WITH AND INTO NEW LEGAL ENTITY ANDERSONS MARATHON HOLDINGS LLC.ANDERSONS INC - TRANSACTION WILL RESULT IN CONSOLIDATION OF TAMH'S RESULTS IN ANDERSONS' FINANCIAL STATEMENTS.ANDERSONS - UNDER LOAN SERVICE AGREEMENTS, CO WILL CONTINUE TO OPERATE 4 PLANTS, BUY CORN, MARKET ETHANOL & OTHER COPRODUCTS AND MANAGE RISK FOR TAMH."}{'symbol': 'MAR', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': "ASHFORD HOSPITALITY TRUST, INC. ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO CONVERT CROWNE PLAZA LA CONCHA KEY WEST TO MARRIOTT'S AUTOGRAPH COLLECTION", 'text': 'ASHFORD HOSPITALITY TRUST, INC. ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A NEW FRANCHISE AGREEMENT WITH MARRIOTT INTERNATIONAL TO CONVERT ITS CROWNE PLAZA LA CONCHA KEY WEST HOTEL IN KEY WEST, FLORIDA TO AN AUTOGRAPH COLLECTION PROPERTY. MARRIOTT\'S AUTOGRAPH COLLECTION HOTELS FEATURE A DIVERSE PORTFOLIO OF APPROXIMATELY 180 INDEPENDENT HOTELS AROUND THE WORLD THAT REFLECT A UNIQUE VISION, DESIGN, AND ENVIRONMENT. THE AGREEMENT WITH MARRIOTT CALLS FOR THE HOTEL TO BE CONVERTED TO AN AUTOGRAPH BY JULY 1, 2022, PURSUANT TO A CONVERSION PROPERTY IMPROVEMENT PLAN ("PIP"). THE PIP IS CURRENTLY ESTIMATED TO BE $13.7 MILLION, APPROXIMATELY $7.8 MILLION OF WHICH IS INCREMENTAL. THE PIP INCLUDES UPDATES TO THE EXTERIOR, GUESTROOMS, GUEST BATHROOMS, CORRIDORS, LOBBY, RESTAURANT, LOUNGE, POOL, AND MEETING SPACE. THE CONVERSION WILL CREATE A DISTINCTIVE THEME AND STYLE FOR THE HOTEL THAT IS COMMENSURATE WITH THE UPPER-UPSCALE/LUXURY AUTOGRAPH PRODUCT. POST-CONVERSION, REMINGTON LODGING WILL CONTINUE TO MANAGE THE PROPERTY PURSUANT TO THE NEW FRANCHISE AGREEMENT. THE COMPANY BELIEVES THAT POST-CONVERSION, THE NEW AUTOGRAPH PROPERTY SHOULD REALIZE A REVPAR PREMIUM TO THE CURRENT HOTEL AND THAT ITS INCREMENTAL INVESTMENT SHOULD YIELD AN APPROXIMATE 19% UNLEVERED INTERNAL RATE OF RETURN. THE 160-ROOM HOTEL IS IDEALLY LOCATED ON DUVAL STREET IN THE HEART OF OLD TOWN KEY WEST WITHIN WALKING DISTANCE OF MAJOR ATTRACTIONS, SHOPPING, ENTERTAINMENT, AND NIGHTLIFE. A UNIQUE AND HISTORIC PROPERTY, DEVELOPER CARL AUBUCHON OPENED THIS LUXURY HOTEL IN 1926 - THE FIRST OF ITS KIND ON KEY WEST.'}{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP FILES SECURITIES CLASS ACTION ON BEHALF OF MATCH GROUP, INC. INVESTORS', 'text': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS FILED A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE NORTHERN DISTRICT OF TEXAS CAPTIONED CRUTCHFIELD V. MATCH GROUP, INC., ET AL., (CASE NO. 3:19-CV-02356), ON BEHALF OF PERSONS AND ENTITIES THAT PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED MATCH GROUP, INC. SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 6, 2019 AND SEPTEMBER 25, 2019, INCLUSIVE. PLAINTIFF PURSUES CLAIMS UNDER SECTIONS 10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934. ON SEPTEMBER 25, 2019, THE FEDERAL TRADE COMMISSION ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAD SUED MATCH.COM FOR, AMONG OTHER THINGS, USING ARTIFICIAL LOVE INTEREST ADS TO DECEIVE CONSUMERS INTO BUYING OR UPGRADING SUBSCRIPTIONS, FAILING TO RESOLVE DISPUTED CHARGES, AND INTENTIONALLY MAKING IT DIFFICULT TO CANCEL SUBSCRIPTIONS. ON THIS NEWS, THE COMPANY’S SHARE PRICE FELL $1.39 PER SHARE, OR NEARLY 2%, TO CLOSE AT $71.44 PER SHARE ON SEPTEMBER 25, 2019, THEREBY INJURING INVESTORS. THE COMPLAINT FILED IN THIS CLASS ACTION ALLEGES THAT THROUGHOUT THE CLASS PERIOD, DEFENDANTS MADE MATERIALLY FALSE AND/OR MISLEADING STATEMENTS, AS WELL AS FAILED TO DISCLOSE MATERIAL ADVERSE FACTS ABOUT THE COMPANY’S BUSINESS, OPERATIONS, AND PROSPECTS. SPECIFICALLY, DEFENDANTS FAILED TO DISCLOSE TO INVESTORS: THAT THE COMPANY USED FAKE LOVE INTEREST ADS TO CONVINCE CUSTOMERS TO BUY AND UPGRADE SUBSCRIPTIONS; THAT THE COMPANY MADE IT DIFFICULT AND CONFUSING FOR CONSUMERS TO CANCEL THEIR SUBSCRIPTIONS; THAT, AS A RESULT, THE COMPANY WAS REASONABLY LIKELY TO BE SUBJECT TO REGULATORY SCRUTINY; THAT THE COMPANY LACKED ADEQUATE DISCLOSURE CONTROLS AND PROCEDURES; AND THAT, AS A RESULT OF THE FOREGOING, DEFENDANTS’ POSITIVE STATEMENTS ABOUT THE COMPANY’S BUSINESS, OPERATIONS, AND PROSPECTS, WERE MATERIALLY MISLEADING AND/OR LACKED A REASONABLE BASIS.'}{'symbol': 'MCK', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'MCKESSON AND AUGMEDIX EXPAND COLLABORATION TO ENHANCE THE DOCTOR-PATIENT RELATIONSHIP', 'text': 'MCKESSON CORPORATION ANNOUNCED AN EXPANSION TO ITS COLLABORATION WITH AUGMEDIX. AUGMEDIX TURNS NATURAL DOCTOR-PATIENT CONVERSATION INTO MEDICAL CHARTS IN REAL TIME, SO THAT DOCTORS CAN FOCUS ON WHAT MATTERS MOST - PATIENT CARE. AUGMEDIX PROVIDES DOCTORS WITH HARDWARE (SMARTPHONES OR GOOGLE GLASS), TO SECURELY LIVESTREAM THE CLINIC VISIT TO ITS CLOUD-BASED PLATFORM. A COMBINATION OF PROPRIETARY NATURAL LANGUAGE PROCESSING (NLP) TECHNOLOGY AND HUMAN EXPERT TEAMS PROCESS THE LIVESTREAM TO ENSURE THE CREATION OF QUALITY AND CONSISTENT DOCUMENTATION. THE UTILIZATION OF AUGMEDIX FURTHER ENHANCES THE EXPERIENCE OF USING EHRS INCLUDING IKNOWMEDSM [3], MCKESSON’S LEADING ONCOLOGY PRACTICE EHR SYSTEM THAT WAS NAMED THE TOP-RANKED EHR PLATFORM FOR ONCOLOGISTS AND HEMATOLOGISTS FOR THE EIGHTH YEAR IN A ROW BY BLACK BOOK™ RESEARCH. THIS HELPS SUPPORT SEVERAL VALUE-BASED CARE DELIVERY INITIATIVES LIKE MERIT-BASED INCENTIVE PAYMENT SYSTEM (MIPS), ONCOLOGY CARE MODEL (OCM) AND REAL-WORLD EVIDENCE GENERATION. THE ONGOING OBJECTIVES OF THE AUGMEDIX DEPLOYMENTS ARE TO RENEW THE JOY OF PRACTICING MEDICINE BY: ENHANCING DOCTOR-PATIENT INTERACTION " ELIMINATING THE NEED FOR THE DOCTOR TO SPEND HOURS EVERY DAY TYPING INTO A KEYBOARD OR PERFORMING BURDENSOME DICTATIONS, AND ENABLING A NATURAL INTERACTION BETWEEN THE DOCTOR AND PATIENT. IMPROVING EHR QUALITY " DELIVERING MORE COMPREHENSIVE AND ACCURATE DOCUMENTATION ALLOWS FOR RIGOROUS QUALITY ASSURANCE. SAVING DOCTORS TIME " REDUCING CHARTING TIME AND/OR DAILY DICTATION TIME REDUCES BURNOUT AND ENABLES INCREASED PRODUCTIVITY. AS A RESULT, DOCTORS WHO USE AUGMEDIX IN THE NETWORK HAVE OFTEN VIEWED THESE SERVICES AS “LIFE CHANGING” AND REPORTED 1.5-2 HOURS OF TIME SAVED PER DAY AND A 60% INCREASE IN OVERALL SATISFACTION WITH THEIR PRACTICE.'}{'symbol': 'MRK', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'MERCK & CO., INC. PRESENTS AT 2ND ANNUAL ADVANCES IN IMMUNO-ONCOLOGY, OCT-08-2019 THROUGH OCT-09-2019', 'text': 'MERCK & CO., INC. PRESENTS AT 2ND ANNUAL ADVANCES IN IMMUNO-ONCOLOGY, OCT-08-2019 THROUGH OCT-09-2019. VENUE: DOUBLETREE BY HILTON HOTEL SAN DIEGO – MISSION VALLEY, 7450 HAZARD CENTER DRIVE, SAN DIEGO, CALIFORNIA, UNITED STATES. PRESENTATION DATE & SPEAKERS: OCT-08-2019, VENKATESWARLU CHAMCHA, SENIOR SCIENTIST. OCT-09-2019, JAD MAAMARY, ASSOCIATE PRINCIPAL SCIENTIST.'}{'symbol': 'FB', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'FACEBOOK, INC. PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-07-2019 03:10 PM', 'text': 'FACEBOOK, INC. PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-07-2019 03:10 PM. VENUE: DUBAI, UNITED ARAB EMIRATES. SPEAKERS: ELENI KITRA, REGIONAL HEAD OF FINANCIAL SERVICES AND AUTOMOTIVE.'}{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': "MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL AND PLAINTIFFS' COUNSEL REACH AGREEMENT TO SETTLE 1 OCTOBER LITIGATION", 'text': 'MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL AND COUNSEL REPRESENTING SUBSTANTIALLY ALL PLAINTIFFS IN LITIGATION INVOLVING THE OCTOBER 1, 2017 SHOOTING ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAVE REACHED A SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT (THE "SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT") TO RESOLVE PENDING LAWSUITS INVOLVING MGM RESORTS REGARDING THESE MATTERS. THE SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT REPRESENTS THE RESOLUTION OF THE COMPANY\'S AND THE PLAINTIFFS\' COUNSEL\'S PREVIOUSLY DISCLOSED MEDIATION EFFORTS. THE TOTAL SETTLEMENT AMOUNT IS EXPECTED TO BE BETWEEN $735 MILLION AND $800 MILLION, SUBJECT TO AND DEPENDING ON THE NUMBER OF CLAIMANTS WHO CHOOSE TO PARTICIPATE IN THE SETTLEMENT. THE ENTIRE PROCESS IS EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED BY LATE 2020. UNDER THE SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT, THE PARTIES WILL DISMISS AND RELEASE ALL PENDING LITIGATION, INCLUDING THE PARTICIPATING CLAIMANTS\' CLAIMS AGAINST MGM RESORTS AND ADDITIONAL PARTIES NAMED IN THOSE CLAIMS, AND THE DECLARATORY-RELIEF ACTIONS FILED BY MGM RESORTS. THE PROPOSED SETTLEMENT IS NOT AN ADMISSION OF LIABILITY BY MGM RESORTS.'}{'symbol': 'MSFT', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'MICROSOFT CORPORATION PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-06-2019 THROUGH OCT-10-2019', 'text': 'MICROSOFT CORPORATION PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-06-2019 THROUGH OCT-10-2019. VENUE: DUBAI, UNITED ARAB EMIRATES. PRESENTATION DATE & SPEAKERS: OCT-08-2019, GREG MOORE, CORPORATE VP, HEALTH TECHNOLOGY & ALLIANCES. OCT-09-2019, MARK SPARVELL, EDUCATION LEADER.'}{'symbol': 'MHK', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'MOHAWK INDUSTRIES, INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 25, 2019', 'text': 'MOHAWK INDUSTRIES, INC., Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 25, 2019'}{'symbol': 'MSI', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'GREENKEY TECHNOLOGIES, LLC ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED FUNDING FROM MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS, INC.', 'text': 'GREENKEY TECHNOLOGIES, LLC ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED FUNDING FROM NEW INVESTOR MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS, INC. (NYSE:MSI) ON OCTOBER 3, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ, INC. PRESENTS AT BENZINGA CANNABIS CAPITAL CONFERENCE, OCT-22-2019 09:50 AM', 'text': 'NASDAQ, INC. PRESENTS AT BENZINGA CANNABIS CAPITAL CONFERENCE, OCT-22-2019 09:50 AM. VENUE: PALMER HOUSE, A HILTON HOTEL, CHICAGO, ILLINOIS, UNITED STATES. SPEAKERS: JAY HELLER, HEAD OF CAPITAL MARKETS.'}{'symbol': 'NTAP', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'NETAPP, INC. PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-09-2019 11:20 AM', 'text': 'NETAPP, INC. PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-09-2019 11:20 AM. VENUE: DUBAI, UNITED ARAB EMIRATES. SPEAKERS: MATT WATTS, DIRECTOR OF TECHNOLOGY & STRATEGY.'}{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'NEWELL BRANDS INC. PRESENTS AT CONNECT 2019, OCT-07-2019 03:15 PM', 'text': 'NEWELL BRANDS INC. PRESENTS AT CONNECT 2019, OCT-07-2019 03:15 PM. VENUE: LOEWS CHICAGO - DOWNTOWN, 455 N PARK DR. CHICAGO, CHICAGO, ILLINOIS, UNITED STATES. SPEAKERS: LEV ZEMELMAN, PIM SOLUTION ARCHITECT.'}{'symbol': 'NEM', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'NEWMONT GOLDCORP CORPORATION, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, NOV 05, 2019', 'text': 'NEWMONT GOLDCORP CORPORATION, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, NOV 05, 2019'}{'symbol': 'NWSA', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'NEWS CORPORATION ANNOUNCES AN ORDINARY DIVIDEND ON CLASS B VOTING COMMON STOCK-CDI 1:1 FOR THE PERIOD RELATES TO SIX MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30, 2019, PAYABLE ON OCTOBER 16, 2019', 'text': 'NEWS CORPORATION ANNOUNCED AN ORDINARY UNFRANKED DIVIDEND OF USD 0.10000000 PER UNIT OF CLASS B VOTING COMMON STOCK-CDI 1:1 FOR THE PERIOD RELATES TO SIX MONTHS ENDED JUNE 30, 2019. THE RECORD DATE FOR THE DIVIDEND IS SEPTEMBER 11, 2019, WITH EX-DATE SEPTEMBER 10, 2019, AND PAYMENT DATE IS OCTOBER 16, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'NIELSEN SPORTS LAUNCHES NEW FAN INSIGHTS PLATFORM FOR CONNECTED VIEW OF FAN BEHAVIORS AND ATTITUDES', 'text': "NIELSEN IS LAUNCHING A GLOBAL, CONNECTED ONLINE PLATFORM TO PROVIDE SPORTS PROPERTIES, SPONSOR BRANDS AND EVENT ORGANIZERS WITH A COMPREHENSIVE VIEW OF FANS' INTERESTS, MEDIA CONSUMPTION BEHAVIORS, BRAND ATTITUDES AND PURCHASING HABITS FROM AROUND THE WORLD. AT LAUNCH, NIELSEN FAN INSIGHTS WILL COVER THE U.S., U.K., GERMANY, FRANCE, SPAIN, ITALY, CHINA, INDIA AND JAPAN. BRAZIL, RUSSIA AND SOUTH KOREA WILL COME ONLINE AT THE END OF 2019 ALONG WITH AN ADDITIONAL 20+ COUNTRIES IN 2020. THE SPORTS INDUSTRY CONTINUES TO FACE MOUNTING COMPETITION FOR FANS' TIME AND ATTENTION AS THE MEDIA LANDSCAPE FRAGMENTS AND SPORTS CONTENT IS CONSUMED ACROSS A WIDER VARIETY OF DEVICES AND PLATFORMS. THIS COMPETITION AND FRAGMENTATION, COMBINED WITH DIMINISHING CONSUMER LOYALTY AND AN INCREASINGLY COMPLEX SPORTS SPONSORSHIP AND MULTIMEDIA RIGHTS MARKETPLACE, FORCES SPORTS PROPERTY OWNERS, BRANDS AND EVENT ORGANIZERS TO REQUIRE MORE IN-DEPTH DATA TO HELP GUIDE INVESTMENT DECISIONS AND DETERMINE ROI. THE NEED FOR ONE SOURCE OF TRUTH HAS NEVER BEEN GREATER. NIELSEN FAN INSIGHTS WILL HELP DRIVE BETTER BUSINESS DECISIONS AROUND SPONSORSHIP, FAN ENGAGEMENT AND MEDIA RIGHTS FOR BOTH RIGHTS HOLDERS AND BRANDS. BY LEVERAGING THE UNIQUE INSIGHTS GATHERED FROM THOUSANDS OF FANS AROUND THE GLOBE, SPORTS PROPERTIES, INCLUDING SPORTS LEAGUES AND TEAMS, WILL BE ABLE TO BETTER UNDERSTAND HOW TO GROW AND ENGAGE WITH THEIR FAN BASES, EXPAND INTO NEW MARKETS, EVALUATE MEDIA RIGHTS, AND SECURE PARTNERSHIPS WITH SPONSORS. THE NIELSEN FAN INSIGHTS' WEB-BASED PLATFORM WILL ALSO HELP SPONSORING BRANDS DISCOVER HOW A PARTICULAR SPONSORSHIP IMPACTS THEIR BRAND EQUITY, FAVORABILITY, AWARENESS AND PURCHASING HABITS AMONG TARGET CONSUMERS. IT ALLOWS BRANDS TO IDENTIFY AND ASSESS PARTNERSHIP OPPORTUNITIES BASED ON METRICS DIRECTLY TIED TO FAN SEGMENTS AND BENCHMARK BRAND PERCEPTIONS AND AWARENESS AGAINST THEIR COMPETITION."}{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION PRESENTS AT STEPHENS NASHVILLE INVESTMENT CONFERENCE, NOV-14-2019 10:30 AM', 'text': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION PRESENTS AT STEPHENS NASHVILLE INVESTMENT CONFERENCE, NOV-14-2019 10:30 AM. VENUE: OMNI NASHVILLE HOTEL, 250 FIFTH AVENUE S, NASHVILLE, TENNESSEE, UNITED STATES. SPEAKERS: ALAN H. SHAW, EXECUTIVE VP & CHIEF MARKETING OFFICER, PETER SHARBEL, DIRECTOR OF INVESTOR RELATIONS.'}{'symbol': 'NOC', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 24, 2019', 'text': 'NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 24, 2019'}{'symbol': 'NLOK', 'date': '2019-10-02 13:30:00', 'title': 'ANOMALI, SYMANTEC ANNOUNCE STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP', 'text': ':ANOMALI, SYMANTEC ANNOUNCE STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP.SYMANTEC CORP'}{'symbol': 'NCLH', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS ANNOUNCES ORGANIZATIONAL CHANGES AT THE NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE BRAND', 'text': 'NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS LTD. ANNOUNCED ORGANIZATIONAL CHANGES AT THE NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE BRAND. THESE CHANGES INCLUDE THE PLANNED DEPARTURE OF ANDY STUART, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE (“NORWEGIAN”), FOLLOWING THE LAUNCH OF NORWEGIAN ENCORE AND THE APPOINTMENT OF HARRY SOMMER, CURRENT PRESIDENT, INTERNATIONAL FOR NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS, AS STUART’S SUCCESSOR. STUART WILL STEP DOWN FROM HIS ROLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019 AND REMAIN WITH THE COMPANY AS SENIOR ADVISOR THROUGH MARCH 31, 2020 TO ENSURE A SMOOTH TRANSITION. STUART JOINED NORWEGIAN IN 1988 AND HELD SEVERAL KEY EXECUTIVE POSITIONS DURING HIS TENURE OF MORE THAN THREE DECADES, INCLUDING: PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER; EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, GLOBAL SALES AND PASSENGER SERVICES; EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF PRODUCT OFFICER AND EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT OF MARKETING, SALES AND PASSENGER SERVICES. STUART WAS INSTRUMENTAL IN MANY OF THE LINE’S KEY ACHIEVEMENTS INCLUDING THE INTRODUCTION OF ITS REVOLUTIONARY FREESTYLE CRUISING OFFERING WHERE, IN AN INDUSTRY FIRST, GUESTS WERE FREED FROM TRADITIONAL SET DINING TIMES IN A SINGLE VENUE AND GIVEN THE FREEDOM AND FLEXIBILITY TO DINE AT WHATEVER TIME THEY CHOSE IN A VARIETY OF DINING VENUES.'}{'symbol': 'PCAR', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'PACCAR INC, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 22, 2019', 'text': 'PACCAR INC, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 22, 2019'}{'symbol': 'PEP', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'PEPSICO, INC. REPORTS EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 7, 2019', 'text': 'PEPSICO, INC. ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 7, 2019. FOR THE THIRD QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED SALES WAS USD 17,188 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 16,485 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 2,855 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 2,844 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 2,100 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 2,498 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 1.5 COMPARED TO USD 1.77 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 1.49 COMPARED TO USD 1.75 A YEAR AGO. FOR THE NINE MONTHS, SALES WAS USD 46,521 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 45,137 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 7,592 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 7,679 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 5,548 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 5,661 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 3.96 COMPARED TO USD 3.99 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 3.94 COMPARED TO USD 3.97 A YEAR AGO.'}{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'EXCELERA NETWORK AND PFIZER PARTNER FOR DISTRIBUTION OF FIRST TREATMENT FOR TRANSTHYRETIN AMYLOID CARDIOMYOPATHY', 'text': 'EXCELERARX CORP. ANNOUNCED THAT MEMBERS OF THE EXCELERA NETWORK WILL HAVE ACCESS TO VYNDAQEL® (TAFAMIDIS MEGLUMINE) AND VYNDAMAX™ (TAFAMIDIS), THE FIRST AND ONLY MEDICATIONS APPROVED BY THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION FOR THE TREATMENT OF THE CARDIOMYOPATHY OF WILD-TYPE OR HEREDITARY TRANSTHYRETIN-MEDIATED AMYLOIDOSIS (ATTR-CM) IN ADULTS. THE TWO ORAL MEDICATIONS WILL BE USED IN ADULTS TO REDUCE CARDIOVASCULAR MORTALITY AND CARDIOVASCULAR-RELATED HOSPITALIZATION DUE TO ATTR-CM. ATTR-CM IS A RARE AND LIFE-THREATENING DISEASE CHARACTERIZED BY A BUILDUP OF ABNORMAL DEPOSITS OF AMYLOID PROTEIN IN THE HEART, WHICH CAN RESULT IN RESTRICTIVE CARDIOMYOPATHY AND PROGRESSIVE HEART FAILURE. APPROXIMATELY 100,000 PEOPLE IN THE U.S. SUFFER FROM ATTR-CM ON OCTOBER 3, 2019, BUT ONLY 1% TO 2% ARE DIAGNOSED. THESE THERAPIES MARK THE FIRST AND ONLY TREATMENTS FOR THE DISEASE. PFIZER WAS AN EARLY ADOPTER OF THE IDN DISTRIBUTION STRATEGY WHEN THE EXCELERA NETWORK WAS CARVED IN AS PART OF A LIMITED DISTRIBUTION OUTLET FOR A SUITE OF PFIZER ONCOLOGY PRODUCTS INCLUDING: BOSULIF® (BOSUTINIB), IBRANCE® (PALBOCICLIB), INLYTA® (AXITINIB), SUTENT® (SUNITINIB MALATE) AND XALKORI® (CRIZOTINIB). PFIZER HAS SINCE ALSO GRANTED THE EXCELERA NETWORK ACCESS TO DAURISMO™ (GLASDEGIB), LORBRENA® (LORLATINIB), TALZENNA® (TALAZOPARIB) AND VIZIMPRO® (DACOMITINIB).'}{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'THE PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP, INC. DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON THE COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 5, 2019; DECLARES QUARTERLY PREFERRED DIVIDENDS ON SERIES B, P, Q, R AND S STOCKS, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 10, 2019, NOVEMBER 1, 2019, DECEMBER 1, 2019, DECEMBER 1, 2019 AND NOVEMBER 1, 2019, RESPECTIVELY', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP, INC. DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON THE COMMON STOCK OF $1.15 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE NOV. 5, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS OCT. 17, 2019.THE BOARD ALSO DECLARED A CASH DIVIDEND ON THE FOLLOWING SERIES OF PREFERRED STOCKS: SERIES B: A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 45 CENTS PER SHARE WILL BE PAYABLE DEC. 10, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS NOV. 15, 2019. SERIES P: A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1,531.25 PER SHARE ($0.3828125 PER EACH DEPOSITARY SHARE, 4,000 OF WHICH REPRESENT ONE SHARE OF SERIES P PREFERRED STOCK) WILL BE PAYABLE NOV. 1, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS OCT. 17, 2019. SERIES Q: A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1,343.75 PER SHARE ($0.3359375 PER EACH DEPOSITARY SHARE, 4,000 OF WHICH REPRESENT ONE SHARE OF SERIES Q PREFERRED STOCK) WITH A PAYMENT DATE OF DEC. 1, 2019, WILL BE PAYABLE THE NEXT BUSINESS DAY TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS NOV. 15, 2019. SERIES R: A SEMI-ANNUAL DIVIDEND OF $2,425.00 PER SHARE ($24.25 PER EACH DEPOSITARY SHARE, 100 OF WHICH REPRESENT ONE SHARE OF SERIES R PREFERRED STOCK) WITH A PAYMENT DATE OF DEC. 1, 2019, WILL BE PAYABLE THE NEXT BUSINESS DAY TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS NOV. 15, 2019. SERIES S: A SEMI-ANNUAL DIVIDEND OF $2,500.00 PER SHARE ($25.00 PER EACH DEPOSITARY SHARE, 100 OF WHICH REPRESENT ONE SHARE OF SERIES S PREFERRED STOCK) WILL BE PAYABLE NOV. 1, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS OCT. 17, 2019.'}{'symbol': 'POOL', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'POOL CORPORATION, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 17, 2019', 'text': 'POOL CORPORATION, Q3 2019 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 17, 2019'}{'symbol': 'RMD', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'RESMED INC., Q1 2020 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 24, 2019', 'text': 'RESMED INC., Q1 2020 EARNINGS CALL, OCT 24, 2019'}{'symbol': 'CRM', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'SALESFORCE.COM, INC. HAS FILED A SHELF REGISTRATION IN THE AMOUNT OF $124.768616 MILLION.', 'text': 'SALESFORCE.COM, INC. HAS FILED A SHELF REGISTRATION IN THE AMOUNT OF $124.768616 MILLION.\n\nSECURITY NAME: COMMON STOCK\nSECURITIES OFFERED: 865,127\nTRANSACTION FEATURES: ESOP RELATED OFFERING'}{'symbol': 'SLB', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'SCHLUMBERGER LIMITED PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-09-2019 03:15 PM', 'text': 'SCHLUMBERGER LIMITED PRESENTS AT GITEX TECHNOLOGY WEEK, OCT-09-2019 03:15 PM. VENUE: DUBAI, UNITED ARAB EMIRATES. SPEAKERS: AMR HUJAINAH, DELFI CHAMPION (DIGITAL |AI| ANALYTICS).'}{'symbol': 'SEE', 'date': '2019-10-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'SEALED AIR CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 20, 2019', 'text': 'SEALED AIR CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DE